    <node id="National Comprehensive Cancer Network">
      <data key="d0">National Comprehensive Cancer Network</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The National Comprehensive Cancer Network is an alliance of leading cancer centers that develop evidence-based cancer care guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Comprehensive Cancer Network is an organization that provides guidelines for cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Comprehensive Cancer Network is an organization that provides guidelines and recommendations for cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) is an organization that provides guidelines for cancer treatment and care.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Comprehensive Cancer Network is an organization that provides guidelines and resources for cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Comprehensive Cancer Network is an organization that provides expert guidelines for cancer care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-81c87ec3c2682da4d531da53f6e5e18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e3a9418b1d7916e3c8717a397bbb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7ea43a74059d6781866faec437f19a</data>
