    <node id="Burkitt Leukemia">
      <data key="d0">Burkitt Leukemia</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Burkitt Leukemia is a rare subtype of B-ALL that is essentially the same as Burkitt lymphoma but is treated differently.&lt;SEP&gt;Burkitt leukemia is a rare and aggressive form of B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Burkitt leukemia is a rare subtype of mature B-cell ALL, similar to Burkitt lymphoma but treated differently.&lt;SEP&gt;Burkitt leukemia is a rare and aggressive form of B-cell ALL that is similar to Burkitt lymphoma but treated differently.&lt;SEP&gt;Burkitt leukemia is a rare subtype of B-cell ALL that is similar to Burkitt lymphoma but treated differently.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-81c87ec3c2682da4d531da53f6e5e18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e3a9418b1d7916e3c8717a397bbb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839625</data>
      <data key="d6" />
