    </node>
    <node id="Social Worker">
      <data key="d0">Social Worker</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Social Worker is a professional who provides support and assistance to patients and their families.&lt;SEP&gt;A social worker helps patients and families navigate the emotional, financial, and logistical aspects of cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;A social worker helps individuals solve and cope with everyday life problems and may assist with mental, behavioral, and emotional issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A Social Worker is a professional who helps patients and families navigate healthcare and social services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
