    <node id="Research Team">
      <data key="d0">Research Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A research team is a group of experts responsible for managing and conducting a clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;A research team collects data and coordinates care for patients participating in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;A research team collects research data and coordinates care for participants in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;A research team is a group of experts that manages a clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;A research team is a group of experts who manage and oversee a clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;A research team is a group of experts who manage and conduct clinical trials.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0</data>
