    <node id="Inflammatory Breast Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Inflammatory Breast Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Inflammatory breast cancer (IBC) is an aggressive type of breast cancer that causes swelling, redness, and warmth in the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammatory breast cancer is a rare and aggressive form of breast cancer that causes redness, swelling, and warmth in the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammatory Breast Cancer is a rare and aggressive form of breast cancer characterized by redness, swelling, and warmth of the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammatory breast cancer is a rare and aggressive type of breast cancer that often presents with redness and swelling of the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammatory breast cancer is a rare and aggressive form of breast cancer that is treatable through various therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammatory breast cancer is a rare and aggressive type of breast cancer that often requires combination therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-562e1870b5e20f8648a2e56d960a1148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839626</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mastectomy">
      <data key="d0">Mastectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">Mastectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Mastectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the entire breast, often used in breast cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A mastectomy is a surgical procedure to remove all or part of the breast, often used in the treatment of inflammatory breast cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-562e1870b5e20f8648a2e56d960a1148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839626</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NCCN Guidelines for Patients">
      <data key="d0">NCCN Guidelines for Patients</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The NCCN Guidelines for Patients are trusted resources that explain current cancer care recommendations made by experts. These guidelines are comprehensive, evidence-based recommendations for cancer care, developed by the National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN). They provide expert guidance tailored for patient understanding, helping individuals navigate their treatment options and make informed decisions about their care.  

The NCCN Guidelines for Patients cover a wide range of cancer types, including lung cancer, kidney cancer, skin cancer (such as basal cell skin cancer), breast cancer, colorectal cancer, rectal cancer, melanoma, and others. They offer information on diagnosis, treatment, management, and support, including topics like fertility preservation, family planning, and managing side effects of chemotherapy, such as nausea and vomiting.  

In addition to treatment options, the guidelines address distress during cancer care, providing guidance on emotional and psychological support. They also include information on cancer screening, such as colorectal cancer screening, and are available online through NCCN.org/patientguidelines, as well as via mobile applications. The guidelines aim to improve patient care and treatment outcomes by offering clear, up-to-date, and actionable information.  

Designed for patient use, the NCCN Guidelines for Patients are developed based on the latest research and clinical practices. They serve as a resource that helps patients understand cancer care, treatment options, and the overall management of their condition. The guidelines are widely recognized for their reliability and are intended to empower patients with knowledge to engage more effectively with their healthcare providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-81c87ec3c2682da4d531da53f6e5e18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-925a474b4538dda470bfd817f9d9a17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b66e38931f28ed6ac9b231faaf202fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf41d1c08e8df109ad214d831867a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee254e84e63bd35682ed56c41cef9247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e247ae57c50c62bded7114986471226e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e3a9418b1d7916e3c8717a397bbb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e138ec8da954a5667dc785e919c86b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68daec67dd8f436d82814b0e61ff21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7ea43a74059d6781866faec437f19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fba176235a4410ba8723447134c92579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
