    <node id="Estrogen Receptor">
      <data key="d0">Estrogen Receptor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Estrogen receptor is a protein found in some breast cancer cells that can influence how the cancer responds to treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen receptor (ER) is a protein found in some breast cancers, influencing treatment options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839628</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Radiation Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Radiation Therapy is a cancer treatment that uses high-energy rays or radiation to kill cancer cells or shrink tumors. It is commonly used across various types of cancer, including basal cell skin cancer, squamous cell skin cancer, non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC), prostate cancer, primary central nervous system (CNS) lymphoma, gliomas, bladder cancer, anal cancer, and perianal cancer. In some cases, it is used alongside surgery, particularly when surgery is not an option or after surgery if cancer remains. Radiation therapy can also be used to target and destroy leftover cancer cells following surgical procedures. It is often administered in combination with other treatments such as chemotherapy. The method may involve external beam radiation therapy (EBRT) or intensity-modulated radiation therapy (IMRT), depending on the type and location of the cancer. While effective, radiation therapy can have side effects, including infertility in some cases. Its application varies based on the specific condition and patient circumstances, making it a versatile but complex treatment option.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594536d6aaa61f8f1699ba50bf218a33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ac9bf8f198bc5ad54fd1a7b843e810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c5e5d6c7a62da56b73abb9a3384301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdcce851d69aa713ed64ba1895bd5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4</data>
