      <data key="d0">Progesterone Receptor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Progesterone receptor is a protein found in some breast cancer cells that can influence how the cancer responds to treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Progesterone receptor (PR) is a protein found in some breast cancers, affecting treatment decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872</data>
