    <node id="HER2 Expression">
      <data key="d0">HER2 Expression</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">HER2 Expression is a biomarker indicating the presence of HER2 protein in cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;HER2 expression refers to the presence of the HER2 protein on the surface of cancer cells, which can guide targeted therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;HER2 expression refers to the presence of the HER2 protein in breast cancer cells, which affects treatment options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb</data>
