    <node id="Immunotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Immunotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Immunotherapy is a treatment approach that uses the body's immune system to fight cancer. It involves stimulating or enhancing the immune system's ability to identify and destroy cancer cells. This type of therapy is considered a systemic treatment, meaning it works throughout the body to target cancer cells. Immunotherapy can be used for various types of cancer, including advanced-stage prostate cancer, bladder cancer, and specific cases of anal cancer. It is also employed in treating cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma (CSCC) when patients are eligible, often using immune checkpoint inhibitors such as Keytruda and Opdivo.  

The effectiveness of immunotherapy may depend on the presence of specific biomarkers in the patient's cancer cells. While it aims to boost the body's natural defenses against cancer, there are potential side effects, such as the reactivation of hepatitis B in patients with a history of the virus. Immunotherapy is sometimes considered before surgery for certain cancer patients, and it is generally classified as a form of cancer treatment that enhances the immune system's capacity to combat cancer. Multiple descriptions emphasize that immunotherapy works by activating the immune system to fight cancer, either through direct stimulation or by improving the body's ability to recognize and attack cancerous cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c5e5d6c7a62da56b73abb9a3384301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
