    <node id="mTOR Inhibitor">
      <data key="d0">mTOR Inhibitor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An mTOR inhibitor is a drug that targets the mTOR protein, which is involved in cancer cell growth and survival.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839630</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Chemotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that uses drugs to kill or slow the growth of cancer cells. It is a cancer treatment that involves the administration of medicines designed to target fast-growing and rapidly dividing cells, including cancer cells. Chemotherapy can be used as a primary treatment or in combination with other therapies such as surgery, radiation, or targeted therapy. It is often administered in cycles, followed by rest periods, to allow the body to recover while maximizing the effectiveness of the treatment. The drugs may be given intravenously, orally, or through other methods, depending on the specific regimen and the type of cancer being treated.

Chemotherapy is widely used in the treatment of various cancers, including acute myeloid leukemia (AML), ovarian cancer, prostate cancer, colon cancer, bladder cancer, and gliomas. It is also employed for advanced-stage cancers and may be used before or after surgery. In some cases, chemotherapy is part of additional therapy for high-grade gliomas or is combined with radiation therapy. The treatment can affect the entire body, making it a systemic approach to targeting cancer cells throughout the body.

Chemotherapy is known to cause significant side effects due to its impact on healthy cells, particularly those that divide quickly, such as hair follicles and digestive tract cells. Additionally, chemotherapy can affect fertility, which is an important consideration for patients planning future pregnancies. While the treatment is generally considered the standard of care for certain cancers, it may vary based on the patient’s condition, the stage of cancer, and other factors. Overall, chemotherapy remains a critical component of cancer treatment, with ongoing research aimed at improving its efficacy and reducing adverse effects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37bca9f4d2ebaeed359c9b4eb7a0c1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc89a92e9a97781ebca0db50abc34939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdcce851d69aa713ed64ba1895bd5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
