    <node id="Cataracts">
      <data key="d0">Cataracts</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Cataracts are a serious long-term side effect of radiation therapy, particularly in the eye area.&lt;SEP&gt;Cataracts are a possible side effect of radiation therapy, involving clouding of the eye's lens.&lt;SEP&gt;Cataracts are clouding of the eye's lens, which can be a side effect of intraocular chemotherapy and treated surgically.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0</data>
