    <node id="Magnetic Resonance Imaging">
      <data key="d0">Magnetic Resonance Imaging</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">Magnetic resonance imaging is an imaging technique that uses magnetic fields and radio waves to produce detailed images of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) is a medical imaging technique that uses magnetic fields and radio waves to produce detailed images of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Magnetic Resonance Imaging is a diagnostic tool for identifying gliomas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3a0f53b4be1d525497f87555d7a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e</data>
