    <node id="Cystoscopy">
      <data key="d0">Cystoscopy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Cystoscopy is a medical procedure that uses a cystoscope to examine the bladder and urinary tract.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a procedure to examine the bladder for signs of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a medical procedure used to examine the bladder and detect cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a procedure that uses a scope to look inside the bladder.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a procedure to visually examine the urethra and bladder using a cystoscope.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a procedure that uses a thin, flexible tube with a camera to examine the inside of the bladder.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a medical procedure used to examine the urethra and bladder for signs of cancer, involving the use of a cystoscope.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa2c7020ce6e89888e81972588726e3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839639</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Proctoscopy">
      <data key="d0">Proctoscopy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Proctoscopy is a procedure used to examine the rectum for signs of cancer or recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;Proctoscopy is a medical procedure that uses a proctoscope to examine the rectum and anus.&lt;SEP&gt;Proctoscopy is a procedure to examine the bowel for signs of cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2c9770fd98dbbe3c7947601fb3e654c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
