      <data key="d0">SmokeFree.gov</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">SmokeFree.gov is a website providing resources and support for individuals seeking to quit smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;SmokeFree.gov is a website offering resources and support for individuals seeking to quit smoking or vaping.&lt;SEP&gt;SmokeFree.gov is a website that provides resources and support for individuals seeking to quit smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;SmokeFree.gov is a website offering resources and support for individuals looking to quit smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;SmokeFree.gov is an online resource providing support for individuals trying to quit smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;SmokeFree.gov is a website providing online support for tobacco cessation.</data>
