      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">BeTobaccoFree.gov is a website offering information and assistance for quitting tobacco use.&lt;SEP&gt;BeTobaccoFree.gov is a website that offers information and assistance for people looking to stop using tobacco products.&lt;SEP&gt;BeTobaccoFree.gov is a website providing tools and information to help people quit tobacco use.&lt;SEP&gt;BeTobaccoFree.gov is a website offering resources and programs to help people quit smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;BeTobaccoFree.gov is a website offering assistance and information for quitting tobacco use.&lt;SEP&gt;BeTobaccoFree.gov is a website offering resources and support for quitting tobacco use.</data>
