      <data key="d2">CDC.gov/tobacco is a section of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention website offering information on tobacco-related health issues.&lt;SEP&gt;CDC.gov/tobacco is a section of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention website that focuses on tobacco-related health issues.&lt;SEP&gt;CDC.gov/tobacco is a section of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention website focusing on tobacco-related health issues.&lt;SEP&gt;CDC.gov/tobacco is a government website providing information on tobacco-related health issues.&lt;SEP&gt;CDC.gov/tobacco is a section of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention website focused on tobacco-related information.</data>
