    <node id="Ultrasound">
      <data key="d0">Ultrasound</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Ultrasound is a medical imaging technique that uses sound waves to create images of the inside of the body. It is commonly used to visualize internal structures, such as organs and tissues, and plays a key role in diagnosing a wide range of conditions. The technique typically employs high-frequency or high-energy sound waves to produce detailed images of the body's internal structures, making it a valuable tool in both diagnostic and procedural settings.  

Ultrasound is frequently used to guide biopsies and to detect abnormalities, including ovarian tumors and thyroid issues. It is also employed as an initial test for suspected ovarian cancer and is widely used in pregnancy monitoring. Additionally, ultrasound is utilized to examine the urinary tract, testicles, and thyroid, helping to identify potential abnormalities or tumors.  

As a non-invasive imaging method, ultrasound provides real-time visualization of internal organs without the use of ionizing radiation, making it a safe and widely accessible diagnostic tool. Its applications span multiple medical fields, including gynecology, endocrinology, and oncology, and it is often preferred for its speed, cost-effectiveness, and ability to provide immediate results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5406c28b41e499fad4ae44f2c44fdd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fba176235a4410ba8723447134c92579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975e540ddee1810d43caf8df4adcf205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9fe20fe42489996573eb1b436128b6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
