    <node id="Nasopharyngeal Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Nasopharyngeal Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Nasopharyngeal cancer is a type of head and neck cancer that occurs in the upper part of the throat near the nasal cavity.&lt;SEP&gt;Nasopharyngeal cancer is a type of head and neck cancer that can affect the eyes, requiring an eye exam.&lt;SEP&gt;Nasopharyngeal Cancer (NPC) is a type of cancer that starts in the nasopharynx, the upper part of the throat behind the nose.&lt;SEP&gt;Nasopharyngeal Cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the nasopharynx, the upper part of the throat behind the nose.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f05c8ea6f7c7b4ba1fb0ff1c1733980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f43f96815f23658d5b24fe95ed4bd5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839646</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Thyroid Gland">
      <data key="d0">Thyroid Gland</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Thyroid Gland is an endocrine gland located in the neck that produces hormones regulating metabolism.&lt;SEP&gt;The thyroid gland is an endocrine gland located in the neck that can be affected by radiation therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839646</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pituitary Gland">
      <data key="d0">Pituitary Gland</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Pituitary Gland is an endocrine gland located at the base of the brain that regulates various bodily functions.&lt;SEP&gt;The pituitary gland is an endocrine gland located in the brain that can be affected by radiation therapy to the head and neck.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
