    <node id="NCCN.org">
      <data key="d0">NCCN.org</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">NCCN.org is the official website of the National Comprehensive Cancer Network, providing cancer care guidelines and resources. It serves as a platform offering patient guidelines and information on cancer treatment, management, and care. The site includes detailed resources on various types of cancer, such as basal cell skin cancer, pancreatic neuroendocrine tumors, and head and neck cancers. NCCN.org also provides guidance on fertility preservation, distress management, and cancer survivorship. Additionally, it offers patient-focused materials, including the NCCN Guidelines for Patients, which cover treatment options, side effects, and management strategies. The website aims to support patients by delivering accessible and comprehensive information on cancer care. It also includes tools such as surveys for patient feedback. NCCN.org functions as a key source of information for both patients and healthcare professionals, focusing on evidence-based guidelines and patient-centered resources. The site emphasizes the importance of personalized care and provides materials tailored to different aspects of cancer treatment and long-term management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f05c8ea6f7c7b4ba1fb0ff1c1733980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9383db20cd696688798a193862cb5cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e3a9418b1d7916e3c8717a397bbb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdcce851d69aa713ed64ba1895bd5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0</data>
