    <node id="Fertility Specialist">
      <data key="d0">Fertility Specialist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Fertility Specialist is a medical professional who helps patients with fertility issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A fertility specialist is a medical professional who helps patients preserve their fertility before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A fertility specialist is a medical professional who helps patients preserve fertility before starting endocrine therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A fertility specialist is a medical professional who helps patients preserve or restore fertility.&lt;SEP&gt;A fertility specialist is a medical professional who helps individuals with fertility issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility Specialist is an expert who helps people preserve their ability to have children before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical expert who helps patients preserve fertility before cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839648</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NCCN Patient Guides">
      <data key="d0">NCCN Patient Guides</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">NCCN Patient Guides are resources provided by the National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) to help patients understand their cancer and treatment options. These guides serve as informational tools that offer guidance on cancer care, treatment options, and management strategies. They cover a wide range of topics, including cancer treatments, side effects, and ways to manage the effects of treatment.  

The NCCN Patient Guides also provide information on fertility preservation for cancer patients, addressing important concerns related to reproductive health during and after treatment. Additionally, they include resources for patients and their families, offering support and insights into the cancer care process.  

Some versions of the NCCN Patient Guides are available through an app, providing accessible information on cancer care and distress management. The guides are designed to be educational resources that help patients make informed decisions about their care. They emphasize patient-centered information, focusing on treatment options, care planning, and overall management of cancer.  

The NCCN Patient Guides are created by the National Comprehensive Cancer Network and are intended to support patients in understanding their diagnosis, treatment, and ongoing care. They aim to bridge the gap between medical information and patient comprehension, ensuring that individuals have access to clear and actionable guidance throughout their cancer journey.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33608457001e818e2b300adae9c6c0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594536d6aaa61f8f1699ba50bf218a33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c80b2d18abb91c5be598d33cf7a33a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee254e84e63bd35682ed56c41cef9247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e3a9418b1d7916e3c8717a397bbb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
