    <node id="Cutaneous B-Cell Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Cutaneous B-Cell Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cutaneous B-cell lymphoma (CBCL) is a type of lymphoma that starts in B cells and appears as nodules under the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous B-cell lymphoma is a type of cancer that affects the skin and requires accurate testing for diagnosis and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a9eb8b01f29fdf214c10bdffac3203</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
