    </node>
    <node id="Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lymphoma is a type of cancer affecting the lymph nodes, which can weaken the immune system and increase the risk of skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphoma is a type of cancer that originates in the lymphatic system, specifically from lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphoma is a type of cancer that begins in the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphoma is an abnormal overgrowth of lymphocytes, which are white blood cells that fight infections.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphoma is a type of cancer that originates in the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphoma is a type of cancer that may have one or multiple tumors appearing on a scan.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphoma is a type of blood cancer that affects the lymphatic system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b00f93aa3d24d0275d4290db3fb2cca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fba176235a4410ba8723447134c92579</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839651</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-Hodgkin lymphoma is a group of cancers that originate from lymphocytes and are distinct from Hodgkin lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Hodgkin lymphoma (NHL) is a type of cancer that originates in the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma is a cancer that develops from lymphocytes, a type of white blood cell.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Hodgkin lymphoma is a group of cancers that originate in the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Hodgkin lymphoma (NHL) is a cancer of lymphocytes, a type of white blood cell.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b00f93aa3d24d0275d4290db3fb2cca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839651</data>
