    </node>
    <node id="Chapter 5">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 5</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 5 focuses on BCR::ABL1-negative or BCR::ABL1-like B-ALL and emphasizes clinical trials as the preferred treatment option.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 5 discusses chondrosarcoma treatment, typically involving surgery to remove the tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 5 is a section of the text that describes Richter transformation and provides guidance for patients.</data>
