    <node id="Antibodies">
      <data key="d0">Antibodies</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Antibodies are proteins used in immunophenotyping to detect specific antigens on white blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibodies are proteins used in immunophenotyping to detect specific antigens on cell surfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibodies are proteins produced by B cells to fight infections.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibodies are proteins produced by B cells to fight infections and are part of the immune system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b63f0a9aec8d42c8426ded05a9bf92b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0786666c65b5bf00705439d5cb60d5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b00f93aa3d24d0275d4290db3fb2cca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81</data>
