    </node>
    <node id="Larynx">
      <data key="d0">Larynx</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The larynx, or voice box, is located in the upper part of the throat and is involved in speech and breathing.&lt;SEP&gt;The larynx, also known as the voice box, is a part of the throat located below the pharynx.&lt;SEP&gt;The larynx is an organ in the neck involved in speech and breathing, which can be invaded by advanced throat cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The larynx, also known as the voice box, is a part of the pharynx located below the pharynx and connects to the trachea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d8e20e6004dd43ae0f68185383b594d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9383db20cd696688798a193862cb5cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f43f96815f23658d5b24fe95ed4bd5ed</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
