    </node>
    <node id="Extrinsic Muscle of Tongue">
      <data key="d0">Extrinsic Muscle of Tongue</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The extrinsic muscle of the tongue is a structure that can be invaded by advanced throat cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d8e20e6004dd43ae0f68185383b594d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Liver">
      <data key="d0">Liver</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The liver is an organ that plays a key role in digestion, detoxification, and metabolism. It is responsible for processing chemicals, removing toxins from the blood, and producing essential substances such as proteins and bile. Located in the abdomen on the right side, under the rib cage, the liver is a large internal organ that performs numerous vital functions. It is involved in the metabolism of nutrients, the production of enzymes, and the regulation of various bodily processes. The liver can be affected by the spread of cancer from other parts of the body, including esophageal, ovarian, rectal, breast, colon, stomach, cervical, anal, and bladder cancers. It is a common site for metastasis in several types of cancer, and its condition may influence treatment decisions, such as the appropriateness of systemic therapy. In some cases, such as with high-dose methotrexate chemotherapy, the liver's function requires careful monitoring. Additionally, the liver may show issues if metabolic panel results are abnormal. The liver is also referenced as a site for biopsy in medical contexts, and it is checked during imaging tests to assess for cancer spread. Overall, the liver is a critical organ with diverse functions, and its health is essential for maintaining bodily homeostasis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-29d1ec9b874dd38ef0f3a4a2081f548e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594536d6aaa61f8f1699ba50bf218a33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3a0f53b4be1d525497f87555d7a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c80b2d18abb91c5be598d33cf7a33a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18089523f6dcd63cfa5664dc1c01618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db4e8318949a3fda5683c53985c6af05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
