      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Cytarabine (Ara-C) is an antimetabolite used in many AML treatment regimens.&lt;SEP&gt;Cytarabine is a chemotherapy drug used in many treatment regimens for AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Cytarabine is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of AML.</data>
