    <node id="Multidisciplinary Team">
      <data key="d0">Multidisciplinary Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Multidisciplinary Team (MDT) is a group of healthcare professionals with expertise in cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A multidisciplinary team consists of various experts who collaborate to provide comprehensive care for pancreatic cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A multidisciplinary team (MDT) is a group of healthcare professionals with different areas of expertise who collaborate on cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6268b6efa690f6e094e443dca6b4cb52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f</data>
