    <node id="Bone Marrow Aspirate and Biopsy">
      <data key="d0">Bone Marrow Aspirate and Biopsy</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Bone marrow aspirate and biopsy is a procedure to collect and examine bone marrow samples for diagnostic purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;A bone marrow aspirate and biopsy is a procedure to collect and examine bone marrow samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow aspirate and biopsy are procedures used to analyze cells and tissues for diagnosis and staging.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57</data>
