    <node id="Imaging Studies">
      <data key="d0">Imaging Studies</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Imaging studies are diagnostic procedures that create visual representations of the inside of the body, used to determine treatment plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging studies are medical tests that produce visual representations of the inside of the body, such as X-rays, CT scans, or MRIs.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging studies are medical tests that create pictures of the inside of the body to help diagnose and monitor cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging studies provide information to guide the treatment plan for AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging studies are diagnostic tests that produce visual representations of the body's internal structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616</data>
