    <node id="Port">
      <data key="d0">Port</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A port is a small, round disc placed in the chest to facilitate the delivery of systemic therapy, fluids, and blood products.&lt;SEP&gt;A port is a medical device used for administering treatment, tailored to individual patient needs.&lt;SEP&gt;A port is a small device placed under the skin to facilitate the administration of chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A port is a small device placed under the skin to allow easy access for chemotherapy administration.&lt;SEP&gt;A port is a small device placed in the chest to facilitate the delivery of systemic therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981</data>
