      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Hematopathologist specializes in analyzing blood-related diseases and cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A hematopathologist is a medical specialist who examines blood and bone marrow to diagnose diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;A hematopathologist is a specialist who diagnoses blood and immune cell cancers, including CLL.&lt;SEP&gt;A hematopathologist is a medical doctor who specializes in diseases of the blood and bone marrow.</data>
