      <data key="d2">Methotrexate is an antimetabolite used in AML treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Methotrexate is an antimetabolite used in the treatment of AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Methotrexate is a chemotherapy drug used to treat various cancers and autoimmune diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;Methotrexate is a chemotherapy drug used to treat primary CNS lymphoma, known for its effectiveness but potential toxicity at high doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Methotrexate is a chemotherapy drug commonly used to treat primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
