    <node id="Intrathecal Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Intrathecal Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Intrathecal chemotherapy is a method of administering chemotherapy directly into the spinal fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;Intrathecal chemotherapy involves injecting drugs directly into the spinal fluid to treat AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Intrathecal chemotherapy is a treatment method where drugs are injected directly into the spinal fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;Intrathecal chemotherapy is a method of delivering chemotherapy directly into the cerebrospinal fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;Intrathecal chemotherapy involves infusing drugs directly into the cerebrospinal fluid to treat cancer cells in that area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b</data>
