      <data key="d2">Standard of care is the best-known way to treat a particular disease based on past clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard of Care refers to the best-known way to treat a particular disease based on past clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard of Care refers to the best known way to treat a particular disease based on past clinical trials.</data>
