      <data key="d0">Preferred Therapies</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Preferred therapies are treatments with the most evidence of effectiveness and safety compared to other therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;Preferred Therapies are treatments with the most evidence of effectiveness and safety.</data>
