    <node id="Treatment Cycles">
      <data key="d0">Treatment Cycles</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Treatment cycles involve periods of treatment followed by rest to allow the body to recover.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment Cycles are periods of active treatment followed by rest to allow the body to recover.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551</data>
