    <node id="Heart">
      <data key="d0">Heart</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Heart is the organ responsible for pumping blood throughout the body, and is examined during a physical exam.&lt;SEP&gt;Heart is the muscular organ responsible for pumping blood throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart is a vital organ that can show up as a bright spot on PET scans due to its high metabolic activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart is a muscular organ that pumps blood throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart is one of the organs considered when determining the suitability of systemic therapy for bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839669</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
