    <node id="Invasive Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Invasive Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Invasive cancer refers to cancer that has spread beyond the surface of the bladder into deeper layers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839669</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Maintenance Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Maintenance Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Maintenance therapy is a follow-up treatment to prevent cancer recurrence after initial treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance therapy is a treatment strategy to reduce the risk of cancer recurrence after initial treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance therapy is a treatment strategy used to prevent cancer recurrence after initial treatment, often involving PARP inhibitors.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance therapy is a follow-up treatment to prevent cancer recurrence, often used after initial intravesical BCG therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839670</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="ALL">
      <data key="d0">ALL</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (ALL) is a type of cancer that affects lymphoid progenitor cells, leading to the overproduction of lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL) is a type of blood cancer that affects lymphoid progenitor cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (ALL) is a type of cancer that affects the blood and bone marrow, characterized by the rapid growth of abnormal lymphocytes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e3a9418b1d7916e3c8717a397bbb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839670</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Red Blood Cell">
      <data key="d0">Red Blood Cell</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Red blood cells are responsible for carrying oxygen throughout the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839670</data>
