    </node>
    <node id="Steroids">
      <data key="d0">Steroids</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Steroids are a type of medication used in the treatment of ALL.&lt;SEP&gt;Steroids are a standard component of treatment for ALL, used to reduce inflammation and suppress the immune system.&lt;SEP&gt;Steroids are medications used in the treatment of primary CNS lymphoma to reduce inflammation and manage symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Steroids are medications used to reduce inflammation and shrink lymphomas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839670</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Multiagent Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Multiagent Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Multiagent chemotherapy is a treatment approach that uses multiple drugs to treat ALL.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiagent chemotherapy is a treatment approach involving multiple chemotherapy drugs to target and destroy cancer cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
