    <node id="Colorectal Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Colorectal Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Colorectal cancer refers to cancers that develop in either the colon or rectum.&lt;SEP&gt;Colorectal cancer is a type of cancer that affects the colon and rectum, with specific treatments and diagnostic methods discussed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee254e84e63bd35682ed56c41cef9247</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
