    <node id="Colon Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Colon Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Colon cancer is a type of cancer that develops in the colon, part of the large intestine.&lt;SEP&gt;Colon Cancer is a common and treatable form of cancer that originates in the colon.&lt;SEP&gt;Colon cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the colon and is discussed in terms of diagnosis, treatment, and management.&lt;SEP&gt;Colon cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the colon and can spread to other parts of the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee254e84e63bd35682ed56c41cef9247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68daec67dd8f436d82814b0e61ff21</data>
