    <node id="Bone Marrow Tests">
      <data key="d0">Bone Marrow Tests</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Bone marrow tests are used to diagnose CML and assess the presence of abnormal cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow tests are used to examine the bone marrow for signs of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow tests are medical procedures used to examine bone marrow for signs of diseases such as CML.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow tests are procedures used to examine the bone marrow for signs of disease, such as leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow tests are used to evaluate blood cell production and can help determine the cause of low blood cell counts.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone Marrow Tests are medical procedures that analyze bone marrow samples to assess blood cell production.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839672</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Supportive Care">
      <data key="d0">Supportive Care</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Supportive Care is a type of treatment that helps manage symptoms and side effects of cancer and its treatment. It is part of cancer care that focuses on managing symptoms and improving the quality of life for patients. Supportive care addresses the challenges of cancer and aims to improve the overall well-being of individuals undergoing treatment. It involves managing symptoms and side effects of treatment to enhance the quality of life for patients with various types of cancer, including ALL and CLL. Supportive care refers to a range of care and resources provided to patients, particularly those with metastatic cancer, to support their health and comfort during treatment. This approach includes interventions aimed at relieving symptoms and improving the quality of life for cancer patients. Supportive care is also described as a component of cancer treatment that focuses on managing symptoms and addressing the challenges faced by patients. It is a treatment approach aimed at alleviating cancer symptoms and enhancing the quality of life. Overall, Supportive Care is a critical aspect of patient care that supports both physical and emotional well-being throughout the cancer treatment journey.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6268b6efa690f6e094e443dca6b4cb52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
