    <node id="Stool">
      <data key="d0">Stool</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Stool is the waste product of digestion, formed in the colon and stored in the rectum.&lt;SEP&gt;Stool is the waste material stored in the rectum before elimination through the anus.&lt;SEP&gt;Stool is the waste product of digestion that is stored in the rectum and expelled through the anus.</data>
