    <node id="CNS">
      <data key="d0">CNS</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The central nervous system (CNS) includes the brain and spinal cord and can be affected by cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;CNS stands for Central Nervous System, which includes the brain and spinal cord, and can be affected by leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;CNS stands for Central Nervous System, which includes the brain and spinal cord.&lt;SEP&gt;CNS stands for Central Nervous System.</data>
