      <data key="d0">Patient Advocacy Groups</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Patient advocacy groups provide support and resources for individuals with AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient advocacy groups provide support and resources for individuals affected by cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient advocacy groups are organizations that provide support, education, and resources to individuals affected by cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient advocacy groups offer support and resources to individuals dealing with cancer.</data>
