    <node id="Biomarker Testing">
      <data key="d0">Biomarker Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Biomarker Testing is a diagnostic process used to identify specific biological markers that can guide treatment decisions. It involves analyzing genes, proteins, or other molecules in the body, such as in tumor tissue or blood samples, to detect the presence or progression of diseases like cancer. Biomarker testing is a type of molecular test that examines the molecular components of a tumor or biopsy sample to identify features that may influence treatment options. It can also detect DNA mutations, protein levels, or other molecular features that indicate disease states or responses to treatment. This testing is often recommended to determine eligibility for targeted therapy or immunotherapy. Biomarker testing helps in identifying specific markers in the body that can indicate the presence or progression of cancer, as well as guide treatment decisions by assessing proteins, genes, or mutations in cancer cells. It is used to detect specific molecules that may be associated with cancer or other diseases and is an essential tool in personalized medicine. The process typically involves analyzing biological markers in tissue or blood to detect mutations or proteins related to cancer. Overall, Biomarker Testing plays a critical role in modern oncology by providing insights into disease mechanisms and informing individualized treatment strategies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-562e1870b5e20f8648a2e56d960a1148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
