    <node id="Biomarker">
      <data key="d0">Biomarker</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A biomarker is a measurable indicator of a biological state or condition, such as mismatch repair deficiency in cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A biomarker is a biological indicator found in the body that can signal the presence of a disease or condition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc89a92e9a97781ebca0db50abc34939</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839677</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Colectomy">
      <data key="d0">Colectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">Colectomy is a surgical procedure to remove part or all of the colon, commonly used in treating colon cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Colectomy is a surgery that removes part of the colon with cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Colectomy is a surgical procedure involving the removal of part or all of the colon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cfcc365cd093374564eb27dcbf5b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839679</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer">
      <data key="d0">NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer are comprehensive resources designed to provide information on cancer care, treatment options, and patient management. These guides offer educational materials that help patients understand their diagnosis, treatment plans, and overall care. They cover various types of cancer, including basal cell skin cancer, rectal cancer, and head and neck cancers, among others. The NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer are available in multiple formats, including mobile applications, which provide accessible information on cancer-related topics such as treatment, side effect management, fertility preservation, and distress management. As both digital and traditional resources, they aim to support patients and their families by offering guidance throughout the cancer journey. The guides emphasize patient education and empowerment, ensuring individuals have the knowledge needed to make informed decisions about their health. Overall, the NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer serve as a valuable tool in supporting cancer patients through accurate, up-to-date, and actionable information.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-925a474b4538dda470bfd817f9d9a17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9383db20cd696688798a193862cb5cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e138ec8da954a5667dc785e919c86b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68daec67dd8f436d82814b0e61ff21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
