    <node id="Hysterectomy">
      <data key="d0">Hysterectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">Hysterectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the uterus, often part of ovarian cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hysterectomy is a surgical procedure involving the removal of the uterus, which may or may not include the ovaries.&lt;SEP&gt;Hysterectomy is a surgery to remove the uterus, including the cervix, for cervical cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hysterectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the uterus, often used in treating early-stage cervical cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Hysterectomy is a surgical procedure involving removal of the uterus, which may affect brachytherapy setup.&lt;SEP&gt;Hysterectomy is a surgical procedure that removes the uterus, often used in the treatment of cervical cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c76786e9d6dbf06ddf5d55af0cf658</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839682</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ovary Preservation">
      <data key="d0">Ovary Preservation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ovary preservation refers to the decision to keep the ovaries during hysterectomy to avoid surgical menopause.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839682</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lymph Node Dissection">
      <data key="d0">Lymph Node Dissection</data>
      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">Lymph node dissection is a more extensive surgery to remove affected lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymph node dissection is a surgical procedure where lymph nodes are removed to test for cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymph node dissection is a procedure to remove lymph nodes to check for cancer spread.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymph node dissection is a surgical procedure to remove affected lymph nodes in the groin.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d994e430bb9890c905d7914fad9c118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
