      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Estrogen">
      <data key="d0">Estrogen</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Estrogen is a hormone that plays a key role in reproductive health and its deficiency can cause menopause symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen is a hormone involved in breast development.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen is a hormone produced by the ovaries that plays a key role in the female reproductive system.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen is a hormone produced mainly by the ovaries and other tissues, and it can promote the growth of certain breast cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen is a hormone that plays a critical role in maintaining reproductive health and preventing long-term risks such as cardiovascular disease and osteoporosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen is a hormone that affects menopause symptoms and long-term health risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-562e1870b5e20f8648a2e56d960a1148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd58424a14d9942181ba4ca3c1ec81c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839683</data>
