    <node id="Head and Neck Tumors">
      <data key="d0">Head and Neck Tumors</data>
      <data key="d1">condition</data>
      <data key="d2">Head and neck tumors are a specific category of CSCC that may require removal of lymph nodes during surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Head and neck tumors are growths that occur in the head and neck region and can affect hearing.</data>
