      <data key="d0">Hepatitis B</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Hepatitis B is a viral infection that affects the liver and can be reactivated by certain cancer treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hepatitis B is a viral infection that affects the liver and may require testing before immunotherapy treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hepatitis B is a viral infection that affects the liver.</data>
