    <node id="Chemoradiation">
      <data key="d0">Chemoradiation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Chemoradiation is a treatment approach combining chemotherapy and radiation therapy, typically not used after certain chemotherapy regimens. Chemoradiation is a combined treatment of chemotherapy and radiation, typically used for locally advanced cancers. Chemoradiation is a combined treatment strategy using both external beam radiation therapy and chemotherapy. Chemoradiation is a treatment strategy that combines chemotherapy and radiation therapy to treat cervical cancer. Chemoradiation is a treatment strategy that combines chemotherapy and radiation therapy. Chemoradiation is a combined treatment approach involving chemotherapy and radiation therapy, often used for locally advanced cervical cancer. Chemoradiation is the combined use of chemotherapy and radiation therapy to treat bladder cancer, often more effective than either treatment alone. Chemoradiation is the recommended treatment for non-metastatic anal cancer, combining chemotherapy and radiation therapy. Chemoradiation is a combined treatment of chemotherapy and radiation therapy recommended for nonmetastatic perianal cancers not eligible for local excision. Chemoradiation is a treatment combining chemotherapy and radiation therapy for non-metastatic anal cancer. Chemoradiation is a combination of chemotherapy and radiation therapy used in the treatment of anal cancer after certain chemotherapy regimens. Chemoradiation is a combined treatment approach using chemotherapy and radiation therapy to treat cancer. Chemoradiation is a treatment combining chemotherapy and radiation therapy for cervical cancer. Chemoradiation is a treatment option for NSCLC that combines chemotherapy and radiation therapy. A treatment combining chemotherapy and radiation therapy to treat cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e247ae57c50c62bded7114986471226e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37bca9f4d2ebaeed359c9b4eb7a0c1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c76786e9d6dbf06ddf5d55af0cf658</data>
