    <node id="Alcohol">
      <data key="d0">Alcohol</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Alcohol use can contribute to the development of head and neck cancer and complicate treatment outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol use is a risk factor for cirrhosis and liver cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol is a substance that can increase the risk of certain cancers and should be consumed in limited amounts.&lt;SEP&gt;A substance that increases the risk of certain cancers when consumed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33608457001e818e2b300adae9c6c0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf41d1c08e8df109ad214d831867a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe</data>
