    <node id="Complete Blood Count (CBC)">
      <data key="d0">Complete Blood Count (CBC)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Complete Blood Count (CBC) is a blood test that measures red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets.&lt;SEP&gt;CBC is a blood test measuring white blood cells, red blood cells, and platelets to assess general health.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-925a474b4538dda470bfd817f9d9a17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154</data>
