      <data key="d0">Pregnant People</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Pregnant people may also have higher CEA levels in their blood, unrelated to cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-925a474b4538dda470bfd817f9d9a17d</data>
