    <node id="Chromosomes">
      <data key="d0">Chromosomes</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Chromosomes are structures containing genetic information, with 23 pairs in normal human cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromosomes are structures within cells that carry genetic information, with 23 pairs present in normal human cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromosomes are structures in human cells that contain genetic material, including the gene responsible for p16 production.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromosomes are structures within cells that contain genetic material and can show abnormalities in AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromosomes are structures in cells that contain genetic material and may show abnormalities in CLL.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b63f0a9aec8d42c8426ded05a9bf92b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
