    </node>
    <node id="Leukemic Meningitis">
      <data key="d0">Leukemic Meningitis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Leukemic meningitis is a condition where leukemia cells affect the outer layer of the brain, detectable through MRI scans.&lt;SEP&gt;Leukemic meningitis is inflammation of the membranes covering the brain and spinal cord due to leukemia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b</data>
