      <data key="d0">Cardiologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A cardiologist is a medical expert who specializes in heart health and evaluates heart function during treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A cardiologist is a medical doctor who specializes in diagnosing and treating heart conditions.</data>
