    <node id="PET Scan">
      <data key="d0">PET Scan</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">PET Scan is a medical imaging procedure that uses a radioactive tracer to detect cancer cells and other abnormalities in the body. The procedure involves injecting a radioactive substance, often a radiotracer or radioactive drug, into the body, which is then used to visualize metabolic processes and cellular activity. PET scans are commonly used to detect cancer cells by showing where they are using sugar from the body, as cancer cells typically have higher metabolic activity and absorb more of the tracer. These scans can also assess cancer progression or treatment response by highlighting areas of increased metabolic activity. In many cases, PET scans are combined with CT or MRI scans to improve accuracy and provide more detailed images. The technique is classified as a nuclear medicine imaging test and is used to create detailed images of the body's functions. While the descriptions vary slightly in wording, they all emphasize the use of a radioactive tracer to detect cancer cells and evaluate their activity levels. Some descriptions mention the injection of radioactive glucose specifically, as it helps identify areas where cancer cells are more active due to their higher sugar consumption. Overall, PET Scan is a critical diagnostic tool in oncology and other medical fields for detecting and monitoring various conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5406c28b41e499fad4ae44f2c44fdd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa14ecd19e2d721cb99ea9590f0ede3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e9c4dc95841db7d0af39e1267ae71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18089523f6dcd63cfa5664dc1c01618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2778e34af702d49d5e70867726e14b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fba176235a4410ba8723447134c92579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9fe20fe42489996573eb1b436128b6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839689</data>
