    <node id="Ovarian Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Ovarian Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ovarian Cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the ovaries and can affect various tissues surrounding them. It is also described as a type of cancer that can originate in the ovaries or fallopian tubes. Ovarian Cancer can spread to other parts of the body and is classified into stages to determine the extent of the disease. It can cause various physical symptoms and is diagnosed through various tests and procedures. Comprehensive diagnostic and treatment approaches are required for Ovarian Cancer. The condition primarily affects the ovaries, though it may involve adjacent structures. Ovarian Cancer is a serious illness that necessitates early detection and intervention for better outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e5406c28b41e499fad4ae44f2c44fdd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
