    <node id="Invasive Breast Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Invasive Breast Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Invasive breast cancer is a type of cancer that has grown outside the ducts or lobules into surrounding tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive breast cancer is cancer that has spread beyond the milk ducts or lobules into surrounding breast tissue or lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive breast cancer is cancer that has grown beyond the milk ducts or lobules into surrounding breast tissue or nearby lymph nodes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7390896141393e0b4d1c15df77b5c0a7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
