    </node>
    <node id="Ducts">
      <data key="d0">Ducts</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Ducts are small tubes that carry milk from the lobules to the nipple in the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Ducts are small tubes that carry milk from the lobules to the nipple.&lt;SEP&gt;Ducts are thin tubes in the breast that carry milk from the lobules to the nipple.&lt;SEP&gt;Ducts are small tubes that connect the lobules to the nipple, carrying breast milk.&lt;SEP&gt;Ducts are tubular structures that transport breast milk from the lobules to the nipple.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7390896141393e0b4d1c15df77b5c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649</data>
