    <node id="Nipple-Areola Complex">
      <data key="d0">Nipple-Areola Complex</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The nipple-areola complex refers to the area of the breast that includes the nipple and the surrounding darker skin.&lt;SEP&gt;The nipple-areola complex refers to the combined structure of the nipple and the surrounding areola.&lt;SEP&gt;The nipple-areola complex refers to the area of the breast containing the nipple and the surrounding darker skin.&lt;SEP&gt;The nipple-areola complex refers to the area containing the nipple and the surrounding darker skin.</data>
