    <node id="Pectoral Muscle">
      <data key="d0">Pectoral Muscle</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The pectoral muscle is a large muscle located in the chest that helps support the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;The pectoral muscle is a large muscle in the chest that helps support the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;The pectoral muscle is located behind the breast and helps support its structure.</data>
