    <node id="Carcinomas">
      <data key="d0">Carcinomas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Carcinomas are a type of cancer that originates in the epithelial cells lining the organs, including the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Carcinomas are cancers that originate in the cells that line the inner or outer surfaces of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Carcinomas are a type of cancer that begins in the cells lining the surfaces of organs or tissues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1</data>
