    <node id="Ductal Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Ductal Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ductal carcinoma is a type of breast cancer that begins in the milk ducts.&lt;SEP&gt;Ductal carcinoma is a type of breast cancer that originates in the milk ducts of the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Ductal carcinoma is a type of breast cancer that originates in the milk ducts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649</data>
