    <node id="Lobular Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Lobular Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lobular carcinoma is a type of breast cancer that begins in the milk-producing lobules of the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobular carcinoma is a type of breast cancer that originates in the lobules (milk-producing glands) of the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobular carcinoma is a type of breast cancer that originates in the lobules of the breast.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649</data>
