    <node id="MyChart">
      <data key="d0">MyChart</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">MyChart is an online patient portal that allows users to track appointments and communicate with their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;MyChart is a digital health record system that allows patients to track appointments and communicate with their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;MyChart is a digital health record system used to track appointments and communicate with healthcare teams.&lt;SEP&gt;MyChart is a digital health platform that allows patients to access medical records, appointments, and communicate with their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;MyChart is a digital health portal that allows patients to access medical records and communicate with care teams.&lt;SEP&gt;MyChart is a digital health record system that allows patients to access their medical information and communicate with their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;MyChart is an online patient portal that allows patients to access their health records and communicate with their care team.</data>
