    <node id="International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics">
      <data key="d0">International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics is an organization that develops staging systems for gynecological cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics (FIGO) is an organization that provides a staging system for cervical cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5</data>
