    <node id="NCCN Cancer Centers">
      <data key="d0">NCCN Cancer Centers</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">NCCN Cancer Centers are a network of leading cancer treatment and research institutions in the United States.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN Cancer Centers are institutions that follow guidelines from the National Comprehensive Cancer Network for cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN Cancer Centers are institutions that provide cancer care and conduct clinical research.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN Cancer Centers are institutions that provide cancer care and participate in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN Cancer Centers are institutions that provide cancer care and conduct clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN Cancer Centers are institutions that follow guidelines from the National Comprehensive Cancer Network to provide high-quality cancer care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67</data>
