    <node id="National Cancer Institute">
      <data key="d0">National Cancer Institute</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The National Cancer Institute is a U.S. government agency that conducts and supports cancer research and provides information on clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Cancer Institute is a federal agency dedicated to cancer research and education.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Cancer Institute (NCI) is a federal agency dedicated to cancer research and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Cancer Institute is a U.S. government agency dedicated to cancer research and clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Cancer Institute is a U.S. government agency that supports cancer research and clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;A federal agency responsible for cancer research and training.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd</data>
