    <node id="U.S. National Library of Medicine">
      <data key="d0">U.S. National Library of Medicine</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The U.S. National Library of Medicine is a federal agency that manages the clinicaltrials.gov database, providing information on clinical trials worldwide.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. National Library of Medicine is a federal institution that provides access to biomedical information.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. National Library of Medicine is a federal agency that maintains databases related to clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. National Library of Medicine is a government agency that maintains a database of clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;A federal agency providing access to biomedical information and resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551</data>
