    <node id="Cancer Information Service">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Information Service</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cancer Information Service is a support service provided by the National Cancer Institute to help patients find clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancer Information Service is a resource provided by the National Cancer Institute to help patients and caregivers find information about cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancer Information Service provides assistance and information about cancer treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancer Information Service is a resource provided by the National Cancer Institute to help individuals find clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancer Information Service provides assistance and information about cancer and clinical trials.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd</data>
