    <node id="Bone Marrow Sample">
      <data key="d0">Bone Marrow Sample</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A bone marrow sample is used in tests like karyotype and FISH to detect genetic abnormalities.&lt;SEP&gt;A bone marrow sample is a collected tissue sample used for diagnostic purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone Marrow Sample is a sample collected from the bone marrow for laboratory testing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b63f0a9aec8d42c8426ded05a9bf92b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0786666c65b5bf00705439d5cb60d5a0</data>
