    <node id="Stem Cell Transplant">
      <data key="d0">Stem Cell Transplant</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A stem cell transplant is a procedure that replaces damaged or destroyed bone marrow with healthy stem cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A stem cell transplant is another term for stem cell rescue, involving the reinfusion of harvested stem cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cell transplant is a treatment option for certain types of cancer, involving the infusion of stem cells to restore bone marrow function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea</data>
