    <node id="Hepatocellular Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Hepatocellular Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC) is the most common type of primary liver cancer in adults.&lt;SEP&gt;Hepatocellular Carcinoma (HCC) is a type of liver cancer that is the focus of the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f</data>
