    <node id="Liver Cancer Screening">
      <data key="d0">Liver Cancer Screening</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Liver cancer screening involves regular tests to detect liver cancer early in high-risk individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Liver cancer screening is a process of regular tests to detect liver cancer in individuals without symptoms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1</data>
