    <node id="Cirrhosis">
      <data key="d0">Cirrhosis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cirrhosis is a chronic liver disease characterized by scarring of liver tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Cirrhosis is a liver condition that increases the risk of developing liver cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1</data>
