    <node id="Stomach Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Stomach Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Stomach cancer is a type of cancer that develops in the stomach and is discussed in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Stomach cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the cells lining the stomach and can spread to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Stomach cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the cells lining the stomach.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c80b2d18abb91c5be598d33cf7a33a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f</data>
