    <node id="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Primary CNS Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Primary CNS Lymphoma is a rare and aggressive cancer that originates in the central nervous system (CNS). It affects the central nervous system, including the brain, spinal cord, cerebrospinal fluid, and eyes. This type of cancer requires diagnostic testing for confirmation and specific diagnostic and treatment approaches. Primary CNS Lymphoma is a type of cancer that originates in the central nervous system and is treated with various therapies. It is characterized by its origin within the central nervous system and necessitates tailored medical interventions. The condition is consistently described as a rare and aggressive form of cancer that arises within the CNS, with varying emphasis on diagnostic methods and treatment strategies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd58424a14d9942181ba4ca3c1ec81c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68daec67dd8f436d82814b0e61ff21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fba176235a4410ba8723447134c92579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0d4d6b091e033fd01aa721422b68ef5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839702</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Stomach">
      <data key="d0">Stomach</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The stomach is an organ in the digestive system that stores and breaks down food.&lt;SEP&gt;The stomach is a muscular, hollow organ that plays a key role in the digestive system.&lt;SEP&gt;The stomach is an organ that stores and breaks down food using acids and enzymes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c80b2d18abb91c5be598d33cf7a33a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d</data>
