    <node id="Targeted Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Targeted Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Targeted Therapy is a type of cancer treatment that uses drugs to target specific molecules involved in cancer growth. It is considered a form of systemic therapy, meaning it works throughout the body to affect cancer cells. The primary goal of Targeted Therapy is to inhibit the growth and spread of cancer by focusing on specific features of cancer cells, such as receptors or proteins that are critical to their survival and proliferation. This approach aims to minimize harm to healthy cells compared to traditional treatments like chemotherapy. Targeted Therapy can be used for various types of cancer, including advanced-stage prostate cancer and bladder cancer. It specifically targets certain molecules or gene mutations found in cancer cells, making it a more precise and personalized treatment option. Some descriptions note that Targeted Therapy may be used for cancers that do not absorb iodine, indicating its application in specific cases. Overall, Targeted Therapy represents an advancement in cancer treatment by focusing on molecular mechanisms that drive cancer progression.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
