    <node id="Insurance Forms">
      <data key="d0">Insurance Forms</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Insurance forms are documents related to a patient's health insurance coverage and claims.&lt;SEP&gt;Insurance forms are documents required by insurance companies to process claims and verify coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insurance forms are documents required to process medical claims and ensure coverage for treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Insurance forms are documents used to request coverage for medical services and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Insurance forms are documents required to process medical claims and coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insurance forms are documents that provide information about a patient's health insurance coverage and are part of organizing medical documents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a9eb8b01f29fdf214c10bdffac3203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839703</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Immune System">
      <data key="d0">Immune System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Immune System is the body's defense mechanism against infections and diseases. It is described as a network of cells and organs that protect the body from harmful invaders, including pathogens and abnormal cells such as cancer. The immune system functions as the body’s natural defense against infection and disease, and it plays a critical role in identifying and eliminating threats. This defense mechanism helps fight infections and diseases by recognizing and responding to foreign substances. Additionally, the immune system is the body's defense network that safeguards against a wide range of health threats. Some descriptions also note that immunotherapy aims to enhance the immune system's ability to combat disease. While there are slight variations in phrasing across the descriptions, they all consistently emphasize the immune system's role as a protective mechanism within the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd58424a14d9942181ba4ca3c1ec81c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc89a92e9a97781ebca0db50abc34939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b00f93aa3d24d0275d4290db3fb2cca3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839703</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Medical Records">
      <data key="d0">Medical Records</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Medical records are official documents containing a patient's health history, treatments, and test results.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical records are official documents containing a patient's health history, diagnoses, and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical records are documents that contain a patient's health history, test results, and treatment information.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical records are detailed documentation of a patient's health information and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical records are detailed documents that contain a patient's health history, treatments, and test results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a9eb8b01f29fdf214c10bdffac3203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa14ecd19e2d721cb99ea9590f0ede3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839703</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Patient">
      <data key="d0">Patient</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Patient is an individual receiving medical care and treatment for a health condition.&lt;SEP&gt;A patient is an individual receiving medical care or undergoing a medical procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;A patient is an individual receiving medical treatment or care.&lt;SEP&gt;A patient is an individual receiving medical care.&lt;SEP&gt;A patient is an individual receiving medical care and undergoing diagnostic tests.&lt;SEP&gt;The patient is the individual receiving medical care and treatment, as referenced in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;A patient is an individual receiving medical treatment or care for a health condition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2778e34af702d49d5e70867726e14b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a9eb8b01f29fdf214c10bdffac3203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839703</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Oncologist">
      <data key="d0">Oncologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An oncologist is a physician who specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An oncologist is a doctor who specializes in the treatment of cancer, including interpreting imaging results.&lt;SEP&gt;An oncologist is a medical doctor who specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An oncologist is a doctor who specializes in treating cancer, including CLL.&lt;SEP&gt;Oncologist is a doctor who specializes in treating cancer and reviews CT scan results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-594536d6aaa61f8f1699ba50bf218a33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee254e84e63bd35682ed56c41cef9247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
