      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Sperm banking is a process of freezing and storing semen for future use in fertility treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Sperm banking is a method of preserving fertility by freezing semen for future use.&lt;SEP&gt;Sperm banking is a fertility preservation method involving the freezing of semen for future use.</data>
