      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Ovarian tissue banking is a process of removing and freezing part of an ovary to preserve fertility.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovarian tissue banking is a method of preserving fertility by removing and freezing part of the ovary containing eggs.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovarian tissue banking is a fertility preservation method involving the freezing of ovarian tissue containing eggs.</data>
