      <data key="d2">A surgeon is a medical doctor who performs operations to treat diseases or injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgeon is a medical professional who performs operations, including thyroidectomy, as part of thyroid cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgeon is a medical doctor who performs surgical procedures.</data>
