    <node id="Test Results">
      <data key="d0">Test Results</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Test Results are medical findings obtained from various diagnostic procedures, including laboratory tests, imaging studies, and biopsies. These results are outcomes of medical tests used to guide diagnosis, assess conditions such as adrenal tumors, and determine treatment plans for diseases like CML. Test Results can be viewed on a computer or printed for record-keeping, and patients can access them through online portals. They serve as critical information for healthcare providers to make informed decisions about patient care. Test Results are findings obtained from medical tests performed on a patient, and they help in both diagnosis and treatment planning. The information derived from these tests is essential for understanding a patient's health status and selecting appropriate interventions. Test Results are also described as medical findings that inform diagnosis and treatment decisions, highlighting their central role in clinical practice.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa14ecd19e2d721cb99ea9590f0ede3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4e845dfd1390f7f94cfb11bee1526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839705</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Thyroid Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Thyroid Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Thyroid cancer is a type of cancer that affects the thyroid gland and is often curable with appropriate treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the thyroid gland and can be classified into different subtypes based on cell type.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the thyroid gland and requires specialized treatment approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the thyroid gland.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the thyroid gland and may require treatment depending on its progression.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839705</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Total Thyroidectomy">
      <data key="d0">Total Thyroidectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A total thyroidectomy is a surgical procedure that removes the entire thyroid gland, often used for more advanced or aggressive thyroid cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Total thyroidectomy is a surgical procedure involving the removal of the entire thyroid gland.&lt;SEP&gt;Total thyroidectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the entire thyroid gland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a273f96e02707e2e87fc43353ed57f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839705</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lobectomy">
      <data key="d0">Lobectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A lobectomy is a surgical procedure that removes one lobe of the thyroid gland, often used for small, low-risk thyroid nodules.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobectomy is a surgical procedure to remove one lobe of the thyroid gland.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobectomy is a surgical procedure involving the removal of a lobe of an organ, typically the lung.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobectomy is a surgical procedure to remove part of the thyroid gland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a273f96e02707e2e87fc43353ed57f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839705</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Radioactive Iodine Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Radioactive Iodine Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Radioactive iodine therapy is a treatment that uses iodine-131 to target and destroy thyroid cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive iodine therapy is a treatment used to destroy remaining thyroid cancer cells after surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive iodine therapy is a treatment that uses radioactive iodine to destroy remaining cancer cells after surgery.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a273f96e02707e2e87fc43353ed57f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839705</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Levothyroxine">
      <data key="d0">Levothyroxine</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Levothyroxine is a synthetic thyroid hormone medication commonly used to replace the hormones no longer produced by the thyroid after surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Levothyroxine is a synthetic form of thyroid hormone used to replace or supplement natural thyroid hormones.&lt;SEP&gt;Levothyroxine is a synthetic thyroid hormone used to replace natural thyroid hormones after thyroid surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Levothyroxine is a synthetic thyroid hormone used to replace natural thyroid hormones after thyroid removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Levothyroxine is a medication used to replace thyroid hormone after thyroidectomy.&lt;SEP&gt;Levothyroxine is a medication used to maintain low levels of TSH in the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a273f96e02707e2e87fc43353ed57f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
