    <node id="Completion Thyroidectomy">
      <data key="d0">Completion Thyroidectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Completion thyroidectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the remaining thyroid tissue after an initial partial removal.&lt;SEP&gt;A completion thyroidectomy is a second surgery performed to remove the remaining portion of the thyroid gland after an initial lobectomy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a273f96e02707e2e87fc43353ed57f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839706</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Thyroid-Stimulating Hormone">
      <data key="d0">Thyroid-Stimulating Hormone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH) is produced by the pituitary gland and regulates the production of thyroid hormones.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid-Stimulating Hormone (TSH) is a hormone that regulates the production of thyroid hormones and is monitored during thyroid treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid-Stimulating Hormone (TSH) is a hormone produced by the pituitary gland that regulates thyroid hormone production.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH) is a hormone produced by the pituitary gland that regulates the function of the thyroid gland.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH) is a hormone produced by the pituitary gland that regulates thyroid function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1130b0f6bbe935ceddbafc6ce2740f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839706</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="COPAY">
      <data key="d0">COPAY</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A copay is a fixed amount a patient pays for a healthcare service, typically as part of an insurance plan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1</data>
