    <node id="Risk Groups">
      <data key="d0">Risk Groups</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Risk groups classify prostate cancer based on factors like PSA levels, biopsy results, and tumor stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk groups are classifications used to determine the likelihood of cancer progression and treatment response.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7</data>
