    <node id="Squamous Cell Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Squamous Cell Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Squamous Cell Carcinoma is a type of cancer that originates in squamous cells, which are found in the skin and other areas of the body. It can develop in various locations, including the skin, mouth, esophagus, head and neck region, nasopharynx, cervix, bladder, and anal area. Squamous Cell Carcinoma is the most common type of mouth cancer, forming in the thin, flat cells of the mouth's mucous membranes. It is also the most common type of anal cancer, originating from squamous cells found in the skin and other body tissues. In the esophagus, it often occurs in the upper and middle regions and is a type of cancer that originates in the squamous cells lining the surfaces of the body.  

In addition to its occurrence in the skin and other external tissues, Squamous Cell Carcinoma is a subtype of lung carcinoma that starts in flat cells lining the airways. It is also classified as a type of non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) and accounts for about 3 out of 10 lung cancers. Some descriptions refer to it as a type of NSCLC that forms from cells lining the bronchi. However, there are conflicting descriptions regarding its classification, with some sources identifying it as a distinct entity rather than a subtype of NSCLC.  

Squamous Cell Carcinoma is also a common type of cervical cancer that arises from squamous cells. It is the most common type of cervical cancer, originating from squamous cells of the cervix. Additionally, it is described as a rare type of non-urothelial bladder cancer, originating in squamous cells found in the outer layers of the skin and other tissues. Some descriptions note that it is the most common type of nasopharyngeal cancer, forming in the thin, flat cells of the mucus membranes. Overall, Squamous Cell Carcinoma is a versatile form of cancer that can affect multiple organs and tissues, with varying prevalence depending on the location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f9a9eb8b01f29fdf214c10bdffac3203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9882c04dd7676c6433074e5e393c72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d249262ff9e7e657de99a30199159cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f43f96815f23658d5b24fe95ed4bd5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa2c7020ce6e89888e81972588726e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c76786e9d6dbf06ddf5d55af0cf658</data>
