    <node id="Germline Testing">
      <data key="d0">Germline Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Germline testing is a genetic test that identifies inherited mutations in genes and is used to assess cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Germline testing is a type of genetic test that looks for inherited genetic mutations that may increase cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Germline testing is a type of genetic testing that looks for inherited mutations present in all cells of the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7</data>
