      <data key="d0">Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Advanced-stage prostate cancer has spread beyond the prostate to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-stage prostate cancer has spread beyond the prostate and is typically a lifelong disease requiring ongoing treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-stage prostate cancer is a condition where the disease has spread beyond the prostate to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer has spread beyond the prostate to other areas of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-stage prostate cancer refers to cancer that has spread beyond the prostate gland.</data>
