    <node id="Cancer Diagnosis">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Diagnosis</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer diagnosis is the process of identifying and confirming the presence of cancer in a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer diagnosis is the process of identifying and determining the type and stage of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer diagnosis is the identification of cancer in a patient, which can lead to emotional and psychological distress.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer Diagnosis is the process of identifying cancer through medical tests and evaluations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe</data>
