      <data key="d2">Cancer progression refers to the spread or worsening of cancer over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer progression refers to the development and spread of cancer over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer Progression is the process by which cancer grows and spreads in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer Progression is the advancement of cancer over time.</data>
