    <node id="Cancer Risk">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Risk</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer risk refers to the likelihood of developing cancer, influenced by genetic factors and other health indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer risk is the likelihood of developing cancer, influenced by factors such as genetics and lifestyle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176</data>
