    <node id="Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Prostate Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Prostate Cancer is a type of cancer that develops in the prostate gland, a small walnut-shaped organ located below the bladder and part of the male reproductive system. It occurs when cells in the prostate grow out of control, leading to the formation of tumors. Prostate Cancer can be localized, meaning it remains within the prostate, or metastatic, indicating it has spread to other parts of the body. The disease is one of the most common cancers affecting males and is often associated with risk factors such as age, race, PSA levels, and genetic conditions. Early detection plays a crucial role in improving survival rates, and diagnostic methods include biopsies, genetic tests, and imaging studies. Prostate Cancer may also be linked to specific genetic mutations, which can influence both its development and treatment options. Treatment approaches vary depending on the stage and aggressiveness of the cancer and may include hormone therapy, surgery, radiation, or active surveillance. Prostate Cancer is typically confirmed through a combination of clinical evaluation, laboratory tests, and imaging, and its management often involves personalized treatment plans tailored to individual patient needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d61a5e7031ea811cc4dcc55a0a0e8fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6d28b36fe82792dfb86e98ef76b3b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e9c4dc95841db7d0af39e1267ae71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7418fb993bb3daa95d8563909da1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697db1653f51e966e79b92eefeb01ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975e540ddee1810d43caf8df4adcf205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
