    <node id="Quality of Life">
      <data key="d0">Quality of Life</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Quality of Life refers to a person's overall satisfaction with their well-being and ability to participate in daily activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality of life refers to a patient's overall satisfaction with their well-being and ability to perform daily activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality of life refers to the overall well-being and satisfaction of a patient during and after cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality of Life refers to a person’s overall well-being and ability to participate in daily activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality of Life refers to a person’s overall enjoyment of life, including their sense of well-being and ability to participate in their usual activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality of life refers to the overall well-being and daily functioning of a patient during and after treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of a person's overall well-being and satisfaction with life during and after cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e9c4dc95841db7d0af39e1267ae71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68daec67dd8f436d82814b0e61ff21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a</data>
