    <node id="Patient Education">
      <data key="d0">Patient Education</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Patient education involves providing information to help individuals make informed decisions about their health.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient education is the process of informing patients about their condition, treatment options, and self-care.</data>
