    <node id="Lung Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Lung Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lung cancer is a type of cancer that starts in the lungs and includes non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) and small cell lung cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the cells lining the lungs and can spread to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung Cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the cells of the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung cancer is a general term for cancers that start in the lungs, including SCLC and NSCLC.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung cancer is a type of cancer associated with smoking and vaping, which can increase the risk of developing the disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung cancer is a type of cancer that begins in the lungs and can be influenced by smoking or vaping.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung cancer is a type of cancer that begins in the lungs and is often linked to smoking and exposure to harmful substances.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
