    <node id="Large Cell Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Large Cell Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Large Cell Carcinoma is a type of NSCLC that forms from large cells found throughout the airways.&lt;SEP&gt;Large cell carcinoma is a type of non-small cell lung cancer that starts in large cells and accounts for 5 out of 10 NSCLCs.&lt;SEP&gt;Large Cell Carcinoma is a subtype of lung carcinoma that starts in large cells and can occur anywhere in the lungs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
