    <node id="Small Cell Lung Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Small Cell Lung Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Small cell lung cancer is a different type of lung cancer, less common than NSCLC, and is covered in another book.&lt;SEP&gt;Small cell lung cancer (SCLC) is a fast-dividing cancer of neuroendocrine cells, making it the second most common type of lung cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Small Cell Lung Cancer is a fast-growing type of lung cancer originating in neuroendocrine cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
