    <node id="Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) is the most common type of lung cancer, with several subtypes including adenocarcinoma and squamous cell carcinoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC) is the most common type of lung cancer, including subtypes like adenocarcinoma and squamous cell carcinoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
