    </node>
    <node id="Bronchus">
      <data key="d0">Bronchus</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The bronchus is part of the airway system in the lungs, leading to the bronchioles and alveoli.&lt;SEP&gt;A Bronchus is a large airway leading to each lung.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839714</data>
