      <data key="d0">NCCN</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">NCCN refers to the National Comprehensive Cancer Network, which provides guidelines for the prevention and treatment of squamous cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN is an organization that provides guidelines and resources for cancer care, including information on lung cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1</data>
