    <node id="World Health Organization">
      <data key="d0">World Health Organization</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The World Health Organization is a global health agency that provides guidance on cancer prevention and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization is a global health agency that provides guidelines and recommendations for cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization is an international organization that provides guidelines and classifications for diseases like gliomas.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization is a global health agency that may provide guidelines on cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdcce851d69aa713ed64ba1895bd5d1</data>
