      <data key="d0">Neuroendocrine Cells</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Neuroendocrine cells are specialized cells that produce hormones and are found in various parts of the body, including the lungs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9</data>
