    <node id="Bloodstream">
      <data key="d0">Bloodstream</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The bloodstream is the network of vessels that carries blood throughout the body, delivering oxygen and nutrients to cells.&lt;SEP&gt;The bloodstream is the network of vessels that transport nutrients, oxygen, and other substances throughout the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c80b2d18abb91c5be598d33cf7a33a</data>
