    <node id="Adenosquamous Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Adenosquamous Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Adenosquamous carcinoma is a rare type of non-small cell lung cancer that contains both glandular and squamous cell features.&lt;SEP&gt;Adenosquamous Carcinoma is a type of cervical cancer that contains both squamous and glandular cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Adenosquamous carcinoma is a rare type of cervical cancer that contains both squamous and glandular cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c76786e9d6dbf06ddf5d55af0cf658</data>
