    <node id="Lung Cancer Screening">
      <data key="d0">Lung Cancer Screening</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Lung cancer screening is a medical procedure designed to detect lung cancer early, often using low-dose CT scans.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung Cancer Screening is a medical procedure used to detect lung cancer at an early stage in high-risk individuals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839715</data>
