    <node id="CD33">
      <data key="d0">CD33</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">CD33 is a cell surface protein found on leukemic blasts, used by targeted therapies like Gemtuzumab ozogamicin.&lt;SEP&gt;CD33 is a protein found on the surface of leukemic blasts, used as a target for certain therapies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b</data>
