      <data key="d0">Gemtuzumab Ozogamicin</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Gemtuzumab ozogamicin (GO) is a targeted therapy that attaches to CD33 and releases chemotherapy inside the cell.&lt;SEP&gt;Gemtuzumab ozogamicin (GO) is a targeted therapy drug that binds to CD33 and delivers chemotherapy inside the cell.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b</data>
