      <data key="d0">Core Binding Factor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Core binding factor (CBF) is a genetic abnormality associated with AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Core binding factor (CBF) is a genetic abnormality associated with acute myeloid leukemia (AML).</data>
