      <data key="d0">FLT3</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">FLT3 is a gene mutation found in some cases of AML, affecting treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;FLT3 is a gene associated with certain mutations in AML, affecting treatment options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b</data>
