      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Gilteritinib is a targeted therapy used to treat AML with FLT3 mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;Gilteritinib is a drug used to treat AML with FLT3 mutations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b</data>
