      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Sorafenib is a targeted therapy used to treat AML with FLT3 mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;Sorafenib is a drug used to treat AML with FLT3-ITD mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;Sorafenib (Nexavar) is a targeted therapy drug used to treat advanced thyroid cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53afdc6713818c4177b64a712ecce11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96</data>
