    <node id="Counseling">
      <data key="d0">Counseling</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Counseling is a form of support provided to individuals to help them cope with personal or medical challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;Counseling is a form of psychological support provided to help individuals address personal challenges, such as quitting smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;A service provided by healthcare professionals to help patients quit smoking.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe</data>
