    <node id="Cutaneous Squamous Cell Carcinoma">
      <data key="d0">Cutaneous Squamous Cell Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma is a type of skin cancer that originates in the squamous cells of the epidermis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma is a common type of skin cancer that occurs in sun-exposed areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma is a type of skin cancer that affects the vermilion lip.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f43f96815f23658d5b24fe95ed4bd5ed</data>
