    <node id="Health History">
      <data key="d0">Health History</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A health history is a record of a person's medical background, including past illnesses and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Health history includes a person's medical background, including past illnesses, treatments, and medications.&lt;SEP&gt;A health history is a record of a patient's past medical conditions, treatments, and medications.&lt;SEP&gt;Health history refers to a patient's past and current health information used to plan treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Health history is a record of a patient's past and current health conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-27b3a0f53b4be1d525497f87555d7a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697db1653f51e966e79b92eefeb01ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648</data>
