      <data key="d0">Computed Tomography</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">Computed tomography is an imaging technique that uses x-rays to create detailed 3D images of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Computed Tomography is another imaging technique used when MRI is not available.</data>
