      <data key="d0">Vital Signs</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Vital signs include blood pressure, heart rate, breathing rate, and body temperature, which are measured during a physical exam.&lt;SEP&gt;Vital signs are measurements of a patient's basic body functions, including temperature and heart rate.</data>
