    <node id="Lung">
      <data key="d0">Lung</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The lung is a common site for metastatic esophageal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The lung is an organ in the respiratory system and is mentioned as a possible site for metastatic cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Lung is a common site for breast cancer metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;The lung is a site where metastasis can occur, as indicated by "M1b – Metastasis is in the bone or other distant sites."&lt;SEP&gt;The lung is a common site for distant metastasis of liver cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The lung is a target site for bone cancer metastasis, as indicated in the M1a classification.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9882c04dd7676c6433074e5e393c72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74f18dd51a0091fc888512458a85b0a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23</data>
