      <data key="d0">Hepatitis C Virus</data>
      <data key="d1">organism</data>
      <data key="d2">Hepatitis C Virus (HCV) is a virus that causes liver inflammation and can lead to cirrhosis and liver cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1</data>
