      <data key="d0">Alpha-Fetoprotein Test</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Alpha-Fetoprotein (AFP) test is a blood test used to detect elevated levels of AFP, which may indicate liver cancer.</data>
