    <node id="Hepatobiliary System">
      <data key="d0">Hepatobiliary System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The hepatobiliary system includes the liver, gallbladder, and bile ducts and is responsible for producing and transporting bile.&lt;SEP&gt;The hepatobiliary system includes the liver, gallbladder, and bile ducts, working together to process and store bile.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f</data>
