    </node>
    <node id="Pelvic Floor Exercises">
      <data key="d0">Pelvic Floor Exercises</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Pelvic floor exercises are a set of physical exercises designed to strengthen the muscles that support the bladder and improve urine control.&lt;SEP&gt;Pelvic floor exercises are a method used to improve control over urine flow.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7</data>
