    <node id="NCCN.org/patientguidelines">
      <data key="d0">NCCN.org/patientguidelines</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">NCCN.org/patientguidelines is a website that provides information on Hodgkin lymphoma in children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN.org/patientguidelines is a resource providing guidelines for cancer treatment and patient care.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN.org/patientguidelines is a website providing patient guidelines on distress during cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN.org/patientguidelines is a website offering patient-focused guidelines on managing chemotherapy side effects.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN.org/patientguidelines is a resource providing patient-focused guidelines on managing cancer and its side effects.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN.org/patientguidelines is a website providing the NCCN Guidelines for Patients on managing distress during cancer care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf41d1c08e8df109ad214d831867a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0</data>
