      <data key="d0">Insoluble Fiber</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Insoluble fiber is a type of dietary fiber that adds bulk to stool and helps promote regular bowel movements.&lt;SEP&gt;Insoluble fiber is a type of dietary fiber that helps add bulk to stool and can aid in managing bowel issues.</data>
