      <data key="d0">Vaginal Stenosis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Vaginal stenosis is a condition where the vagina becomes shorter and narrower due to radiation therapy, causing discomfort during sex or exams.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition causing narrowing and shortening of the vagina, often due to radiation therapy or surgery.</data>
