    <node id="Perianal Region">
      <data key="d0">Perianal Region</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The perianal region includes the anal opening and the surrounding skin, and can be affected by anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The perianal region is the area around the anal opening, including the skin directly surrounding it.&lt;SEP&gt;The perianal region includes the anal opening and the skin directly surrounding it.&lt;SEP&gt;The area surrounding the anal opening.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7</data>
