    </node>
    <node id="Deficient Mismatch Repair">
      <data key="d0">Deficient Mismatch Repair</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Deficient mismatch repair is a condition where DNA repair mechanisms fail, leading to microsatellite instability.&lt;SEP&gt;Deficient mismatch repair (dMMR) is a condition where the body's ability to correct DNA errors is impaired, leading to genetic instability.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839736</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tumor Mutational Burden-High">
      <data key="d0">Tumor Mutational Burden-High</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tumor mutational burden-high (TMB-H) indicates a high number of mutations in a tumor's DNA, which can influence treatment response.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumor mutational burden-high (TMB-H) is a measure of genetic changes in cancer cells that may predict response to immunotherapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839736</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors">
      <data key="d0">Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Immune checkpoint inhibitors are a type of immunotherapy used to treat cancer by enhancing the immune system's ability to attack cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune checkpoint inhibitors are drugs that help the immune system recognize and attack cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune checkpoint inhibitors are a type of immunotherapy that helps the immune system recognize and attack cancer cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
