    <node id="Adrenal Gland Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Adrenal Gland Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Adrenal gland cancer is a rare type of cancer that affects the adrenal glands and can be classified into different types such as adrenocortical carcinoma and neuroblastoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688</data>
