      <data key="d0">Adrenocortical Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">Adrenocortical carcinoma is a rare type of cancer that originates in the adrenal cortex.&lt;SEP&gt;Adrenocortical carcinoma is a type of adrenal cancer that starts in the adrenal cortex and can be functioning or nonfunctioning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172</data>
