    </node>
    <node id="Endocrine System">
      <data key="d0">Endocrine System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The endocrine system is composed of glands that produce hormones, which regulate various bodily functions.&lt;SEP&gt;The endocrine system consists of tissues and organs that produce hormones, which regulate various bodily functions.&lt;SEP&gt;The endocrine system is made up of organs and tissues that produce hormones, which regulate various bodily functions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172</data>
