      <data key="d1">condition</data>
      <data key="d2">Li-Fraumeni syndrome is a hereditary condition associated with an increased risk of adrenal tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Li-Fraumeni syndrome is a genetic disorder that increases the risk of pancreatic cancer.</data>
