    <node id="BRCA1">
      <data key="d0">BRCA1</data>
      <data key="d1">gene</data>
      <data key="d2">BRCA1 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer when mutated.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA1 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer, and its mutation status can influence treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA1 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer, and may also be linked to prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA1 is a gene associated with an increased risk of prostate, breast, and ovarian cancers when mutated.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA1 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast cancer, and its mutation is a criterion for PARP inhibitor use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
