      <data key="d1">gene</data>
      <data key="d2">BRCA2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer when mutated.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer, and its mutation status can influence treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer, and may also be linked to prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of prostate, breast, and ovarian cancers when mutated.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast cancer, and its mutation is a criterion for PARP inhibitor use.</data>
