      <data key="d0">Digestive Tract</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The digestive tract is part of the digestive system, including the esophagus, stomach, and intestines.&lt;SEP&gt;The digestive tract is the system of organs involved in breaking down food and absorbing nutrients.</data>
