    <node id="Bloating">
      <data key="d0">Bloating</data>
      <data key="d1">symptom</data>
      <data key="d2">Bloating is a common symptom of ovarian cancer, characterized by a feeling of fullness or swelling in the abdomen.&lt;SEP&gt;Bloating is a symptom of ovarian cancer characterized by a feeling of fullness or swelling in the abdomen.</data>
