    <node id="Feeling Full Quickly">
      <data key="d0">Feeling Full Quickly</data>
      <data key="d1">symptom</data>
      <data key="d2">Feeling full quickly is a symptom of ovarian cancer, where a person feels satiated after eating only a small amount of food.&lt;SEP&gt;Feeling Full Quickly is a symptom of ovarian cancer where the patient feels satiated after eating small amounts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154</data>
