    <node id="Testing">
      <data key="d0">Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Testing is a critical process used to diagnose and treat various medical conditions, including basal cell skin cancer, adrenal tumors, chronic myeloid leukemia (CML), and bone cancer. It involves a range of diagnostic procedures such as biopsies, imaging techniques, blood tests, and bone marrow tests. Testing is also used to monitor diseases over time, helping healthcare providers track the progression of conditions and evaluate the effectiveness of treatments. The process may include biomarker testing and tumor mutation analysis to provide more detailed insights into a patient's condition. Overall, testing plays a vital role in identifying health issues, guiding treatment decisions, and ensuring appropriate care for patients with different medical needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc8d8e5ed4f165f3e56305a7644ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839740</data>
