    </node>
    <node id="BRCA Mutation">
      <data key="d0">BRCA Mutation</data>
      <data key="d1">mutation</data>
      <data key="d2">A BRCA mutation refers to a change in the BRCA1 or BRCA2 genes that increases the risk of certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA Mutation is a genetic change in the BRCA genes that increases the risk of ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA mutation is a genetic alteration associated with increased risk of ovarian cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981</data>
