    </node>
    <node id="Pedunculated Polyps">
      <data key="d0">Pedunculated Polyps</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Pedunculated polyps are mushroom-shaped growths with a stalk that protrude from the rectal wall.&lt;SEP&gt;Pedunculated polyps are a type of polyp that has a stalk and a rounded top, resembling a mushroom.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee254e84e63bd35682ed56c41cef9247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2c9770fd98dbbe3c7947601fb3e654c</data>
