    <node id="Contrast Solution">
      <data key="d0">Contrast Solution</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Contrast solution is a substance used in medical imaging to enhance visibility of internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;A contrast solution is used during urograms to improve visibility of the urinary tract during imaging.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3</data>
