    <node id="NSCLC">
      <data key="d0">NSCLC</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) is the most common type of lung cancer and is covered in a separate section of the text.&lt;SEP&gt;NSCLC stands for Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer, a type of lung cancer that originates in the cells of the lung.&lt;SEP&gt;NSCLC is a type of lung cancer that is discussed in the context of causes, risk factors, and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
