    <node id="Thoracic Radiologist">
      <data key="d0">Thoracic Radiologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Thoracic Radiologist is a doctor who specializes in imaging of the chest and interpreting related medical images.&lt;SEP&gt;A Thoracic Radiologist is a medical doctor specializing in imaging of the chest and related structures.&lt;SEP&gt;A thoracic radiologist is a medical specialist who interprets imaging studies related to the chest and lungs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
