      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Thoracic Surgeon is a doctor who specializes in surgical procedures involving the chest.&lt;SEP&gt;A Thoracic Surgeon is a medical doctor specializing in surgical procedures within the chest cavity.&lt;SEP&gt;A thoracic surgeon is a surgeon who specializes in operating on the chest, including the lungs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
