    <node id="Spine">
      <data key="d0">Spine</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The spine is the backbone, providing structural support and protection for the spinal cord.&lt;SEP&gt;Spine is a common site for breast cancer metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;The spine, or vertebral column, consists of vertebrae, including the sacrum and tailbone (coccyx).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74f18dd51a0091fc888512458a85b0a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb</data>
