    </node>
    <node id="Lamina Propria">
      <data key="d0">Lamina Propria</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Lamina propria is a thin layer of connective tissue beneath the epithelium.&lt;SEP&gt;Lamina propria is a type of connective tissue found under the epithelium.&lt;SEP&gt;Lamina propria is the connective tissue layer beneath the epithelium in the oral mucosa.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f43f96815f23658d5b24fe95ed4bd5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06</data>
