      <data key="d0">Smooth Muscle</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Smooth muscle is a type of muscle found in the lower esophagus, not under voluntary control.&lt;SEP&gt;Smooth muscle is involuntary and found in the lower esophagus.</data>
