      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">An excision biopsy removes all or part of a lesion, used to obtain an accurate diagnosis of skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An excision biopsy is a procedure where all or part of a lesion is removed.</data>
