    <node id="Treatments">
      <data key="d0">Treatments</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Treatments are medical interventions used to manage or cure diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatments refer to the various medical interventions used to manage anal and perianal cancer, including surgery, chemotherapy, and radiation.</data>
