      <data key="d2">A hospital is a medical facility where more complex procedures and treatments are performed.&lt;SEP&gt;A hospital is a place where patients receive medical care and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A hospital is a medical facility that provides inpatient and outpatient care.</data>
