    </node>
    <node id="Actinic Keratosis">
      <data key="d0">Actinic Keratosis</data>
      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">Actinic keratosis is a precancerous skin condition caused by long-term sun exposure that can progress to squamous cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Actinic keratosis is a skin condition characterized by rough, scaly patches caused by sun damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Actinic keratosis is a precancerous skin condition that can develop into squamous cell skin cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d994e430bb9890c905d7914fad9c118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839745</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lymphatic Fluid">
      <data key="d0">Lymphatic Fluid</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Lymphatic fluid is a clear fluid that circulates through the lymphatic system and carries waste and immune cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphatic fluid is another term for lymph, a clear fluid that carries infection-fighting white blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphatic fluid is a clear fluid that circulates through the lymphatic system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839745</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Marjolins Ulcer">
      <data key="d0">Marjolins Ulcer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Marjolin’s ulcer is a type of squamous cell carcinoma that develops in scars or chronic wounds such as ulcers and burns.&lt;SEP&gt;Marjolin’s ulcer is a type of squamous cell skin cancer that forms in old wounds, burns, or scars and can be more difficult to treat.&lt;SEP&gt;Marjolin’s ulcer is a type of squamous cell skin cancer that develops in old wounds, burns, or scars.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ac9bf8f198bc5ad54fd1a7b843e810</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839745</data>
