    </node>
    <node id="Sun Exposure">
      <data key="d0">Sun Exposure</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sun exposure is a major risk factor for basal cell skin cancer, as UV radiation damages skin cell DNA.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun exposure refers to the amount of ultraviolet radiation a person receives from the sun, increasing skin cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun exposure refers to the amount of time a person spends in sunlight, which can increase the risk of skin cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1379433bc205cdec8af2edc77613acb</data>
