      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Skin lesions are abnormal growths on the skin that can indicate the presence of basal cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin lesions are abnormal changes in the skin that may indicate disease or injury.</data>
