    <node id="Burns">
      <data key="d0">Burns</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Burns are injuries that can lead to the development of squamous cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Burns are injuries that can lead to the development of Marjolin’s ulcer, a form of squamous cell carcinoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Burns are injuries caused by heat, chemicals, electricity, or radiation.</data>
