    <node id="Scars">
      <data key="d0">Scars</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Scars are areas of damaged skin that can become sites for squamous cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Scars are marks left on the skin after a wound has healed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1379433bc205cdec8af2edc77613acb</data>
