    <node id="Skin">
      <data key="d0">Skin</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Skin is the body's largest organ, serving as a protective barrier and regulating body temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin is the outer layer of the body that protects internal organs and regulates temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;The skin is a part of the body that may show signs of leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin is the largest organ of the body and can be affected by certain types of lymphomas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66dd071b6c2be50e36cee1a1c1bd3b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db4e8318949a3fda5683c53985c6af05</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839747</data>
