    <node id="Radical Cystectomy">
      <data key="d0">Radical Cystectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">Radical cystectomy is a major surgery that removes the entire bladder and nearby lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Radical cystectomy is a major surgery for muscle-invasive bladder cancer that involves removing the bladder and surrounding organs.&lt;SEP&gt;Radical cystectomy is a surgical procedure involving the removal of the bladder, often considered as an alternative to trimodal therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-13e723cb8b0af4bcf2f1b0fd37912cb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10</data>
