      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The seminal vesicles are glands that produce part of the fluid that becomes semen.&lt;SEP&gt;Seminal Vesicles are glands that produce part of the fluid that becomes semen.&lt;SEP&gt;The Seminal Vesicles are two glands that produce and store part of the fluid that becomes semen.&lt;SEP&gt;Seminal vesicles are glands that produce fluid for semen.</data>
