    <node id="Diagnosis">
      <data key="d0">Diagnosis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Diagnosis is the process of identifying a disease or condition based on symptoms, tests, and medical history. It typically involves a thorough evaluation of a patient's health history, physical examination, and diagnostic procedures to determine the nature and cause of a medical issue. Diagnosis can include various tests such as endoscopy, biopsy, and imaging, which help in confirming the presence and stage of conditions like cancer. In the case of skin cancer, diagnosis involves examining lesions and performing a skin biopsy to confirm the presence of cancer. Diagnosis is also defined as the identification of a medical condition through symptoms and medical evaluations. While some descriptions emphasize the use of tests, others highlight the role of symptoms and clinical judgment in the diagnostic process. Overall, diagnosis serves as a critical step in healthcare, guiding treatment decisions and patient care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eafb110f88c7af38808f77f59ed155d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a80cd0ae47fda3849b101cca91a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839749</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Urologist">
      <data key="d0">Urologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A urologist is a medical doctor specializing in treating diseases of the urinary system and male reproductive organs.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist is a medical doctor specializing in diseases of the urinary system and male reproductive organs.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist specializes in the urinary system and male reproductive organs and provides expertise in diagnosing and treating related cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist is a medical specialist who performs cystoscopies and removes tissue samples or small tumors during the procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Urologist is a medical doctor who specializes in diseases of the urinary tract and male reproductive system.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist is a medical doctor who specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of urinary system disorders, including bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-13e723cb8b0af4bcf2f1b0fd37912cb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975e540ddee1810d43caf8df4adcf205</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
