    <node id="Pregnancy">
      <data key="d0">Pregnancy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Pregnancy is a condition that requires careful planning, especially for individuals undergoing cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Pregnancy is the process of carrying a developing fetus in the uterus, requiring the functioning of the ovaries and other reproductive organs.&lt;SEP&gt;Pregnancy is a condition that may be affected by cancer treatment and requires careful consideration.&lt;SEP&gt;Pregnancy is the condition of carrying a developing fetus, which requires special consideration during cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
