    <node id="Blood in Urine">
      <data key="d0">Blood in Urine</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Blood in urine is a possible complication after a biopsy, typically resolving within a few weeks.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood in urine is a possible short-term complication after a biopsy, typically resolving within a few days.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood in urine is a symptom that may indicate the presence of cancer or other urinary tract issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176</data>
