    <node id="Bleeding">
      <data key="d0">Bleeding</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Bleeding is a potential side effect of chemotherapy, often related to low blood cell counts.&lt;SEP&gt;Bleeding is a possible complication following a biopsy, occurring in the rectum or other areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Bleeding is a possible complication after a biopsy, which may occur from the rectum or other areas depending on the procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Bleeding from the urethra is a possible side effect after a cystoscopy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981</data>
