    <node id="X-Rays">
      <data key="d0">X-Rays</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">X-Rays are imaging techniques that use radiation to create images of the body's internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;X-Rays are a form of ionizing radiation used in medical imaging to produce images of the body's internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;X-rays are a form of electromagnetic radiation used in medical imaging to create images of the inside of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;X-Rays are a form of high-energy radiation used in radiation therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;X-Rays are used in CT scans to create cross-sectional images of the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f</data>
