      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">5-Fluorouracil is a chemotherapy drug applied directly to the skin for treating actinic keratosis.&lt;SEP&gt;5-Fluorouracil is a chemotherapy drug applied directly to the skin for treating early squamous cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;5-Fluorouracil is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of colon cancer, often combined with leucovorin.</data>
