    <node id="PARP Inhibitors">
      <data key="d0">PARP Inhibitors</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">PARP inhibitors are targeted therapies used in maintenance treatment for ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;PARP inhibitors are targeted therapies used to treat cancers with specific genetic mutations, such as those involving BRCA1 or BRCA2.&lt;SEP&gt;PARP inhibitors are drugs that block the PARP protein, leading to cancer cell death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981</data>
