      <data key="d0">Olaparib</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Olaparib is a PARP inhibitor used in maintenance therapy for ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Olaparib is a PARP inhibitor used in maintenance therapy for ovarian cancer, typically continued for up to 2 years.&lt;SEP&gt;Olaparib is a PARP inhibitor used in the treatment of breast cancer with BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
