    <node id="Pembrolizumab">
      <data key="d0">Pembrolizumab</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Pembrolizumab is a PD-1 inhibitor used to treat squamous cell skin cancer and other cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Pembrolizumab is an example of an immunotherapy drug used in the treatment of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Pembrolizumab is a checkpoint inhibitor used in the treatment of dMMR/MSI-H cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Pembrolizumab (Keytruda) is an immune checkpoint inhibitor used in immunotherapy for certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Pembrolizumab is a drug used to treat certain types of cancer, including MSI-H/dMMR tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Pembrolizumab (Keytruda) is an immune checkpoint inhibitor used in the treatment of metastatic anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0</data>
