      <data key="d2">Keytruda is the brand name for pembrolizumab, an immunotherapy drug used in the treatment of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Keytruda is the brand name for Pembrolizumab, a medication used in cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Keytruda (pembrolizumab) is a checkpoint inhibitor used to treat bladder cancer and other cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b513355d29308e212a3074ba326b10</data>
