    <node id="Androgen">
      <data key="d0">Androgen</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Androgen is a hormone produced by the adrenal glands, testicles, and ovaries, and it can influence the growth of breast cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408</data>
