    <node id="Ovarian Ablation">
      <data key="d0">Ovarian Ablation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Ovarian ablation is a treatment that stops hormone production in premenopausal women.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovarian ablation is a treatment that uses radiation to stop the ovaries from making hormones.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
