    <node id="FDG-PET/CT Scan">
      <data key="d0">FDG-PET/CT Scan</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">FDG-PET/CT scan is a combined imaging technique that uses a radiotracer called fluorodeoxyglucose to detect cancer and combines positron emission tomography with computed tomography.&lt;SEP&gt;FDG-PET/CT scan is a type of imaging test used to detect cancer recurrence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ad38c9dc069a8ff8df58c42f00eba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a</data>
