    <node id="Multidisciplinary Care">
      <data key="d0">Multidisciplinary Care</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Multidisciplinary Care is an approach where multiple healthcare professionals work together to provide comprehensive patient care.&lt;SEP&gt;Multidisciplinary Care refers to a team-based approach involving multiple medical professionals to support patient treatment and recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Multidisciplinary care is an approach where multiple specialists work together to provide comprehensive treatment for complex conditions like bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68daec67dd8f436d82814b0e61ff21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
