    <node id="Primary Care Doctor">
      <data key="d0">Primary Care Doctor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Primary Care Doctor is a physician who provides general medical care and coordinates other specialists.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary care doctor manages non-cancer-related medical care and helps coordinate communication with the cancer care team.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary care doctor is a physician who provides ongoing medical care and coordinates treatment for a patient.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
