      <data key="d2">Advanced practice providers include nurse practitioners, physician assistants, and certified nurse midwives who provide a wide range of health care services.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced practice providers include nurse practitioners and physician assistants who monitor patient health and provide care.</data>
