      <data key="d2">A psychologist is a mental health professional who helps patients cope with emotional and psychological challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;A Psychologist is a mental health professional who helps patients cope with emotional and psychological challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;A psychologist is a mental health expert who helps manage emotional and psychological issues.</data>
