    <node id="Biopsy Sample">
      <data key="d0">Biopsy Sample</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A biopsy sample is a tissue or fluid sample taken for analysis to confirm cancer presence and determine its subtype.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy sample is a tissue or cell sample taken from the body for diagnostic testing, including biomarker analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy sample is a small piece of tissue removed for testing to check for cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd</data>
