    <node id="Spinal Cord">
      <data key="d0">Spinal Cord</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The spinal cord is part of the central nervous system and can be affected by primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;The spinal cord is part of the central nervous system and may be affected by primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;The spinal cord is a bundle of nerves that runs from the base of the brain down the back, transmitting signals between the brain and the rest of the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0d4d6b091e033fd01aa721422b68ef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd58424a14d9942181ba4ca3c1ec81c1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839763</data>
