    <node id="Brain Tumor">
      <data key="d0">Brain Tumor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A brain tumor is an abnormal growth of cells in the brain, which can be benign or malignant.&lt;SEP&gt;A brain tumor is an abnormal growth of cells in the brain, often causing symptoms due to pressure or invasion of brain tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;A brain tumor is an abnormal growth in the brain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
