    <node id="SISCCA">
      <data key="d0">SISCCA</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">SISCCA refers to a condition that is less advanced than invasive anal cancer and is not covered by the information in this guide.&lt;SEP&gt;Superficially invasive squamous cell carcinoma (SISCCA) is an early form of anal cancer that is small and not deep.</data>
