    <node id="Excisional Biopsy">
      <data key="d0">Excisional Biopsy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Excisional Biopsy is a biopsy method that removes the entire abnormal area.&lt;SEP&gt;An excisional biopsy is a procedure that removes an entire lymph node for examination.&lt;SEP&gt;An excisional biopsy is a procedure where all or part of a lymph node is removed by cutting into the skin for testing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a18089523f6dcd63cfa5664dc1c01618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9fe20fe42489996573eb1b436128b6</data>
