    <node id="HIV">
      <data key="d0">HIV</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">HIV is a virus that weakens the immune system and is linked to an increased risk of primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;HIV is a virus that weakens the immune system, making it harder to clear HPV infections.&lt;SEP&gt;HIV is a virus that increases the risk of developing anal cancer and testing for HIV is recommended.&lt;SEP&gt;HIV infection is a risk factor for anal cancer, contributing to immunosuppression.&lt;SEP&gt;HIV is a virus that increases the risk of developing anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a18089523f6dcd63cfa5664dc1c01618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd58424a14d9942181ba4ca3c1ec81c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9530f389987c13273449ab22a85170ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6</data>
