      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Precancer refers to abnormal cells on the surface of the anal canal or perianal region that may lead to cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Precancer refers to abnormal cells that may develop into cancer, such as stage 0 anal cancer or anal dysplasia.</data>
