    <node id="Guide 1">
      <data key="d0">Guide 1</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Guide 1 is a section explaining how Hodgkin Lymphoma is diagnosed and the testing procedures involved.&lt;SEP&gt;Guide 1 provides information on how to determine cancer risk based on Gleason scores.&lt;SEP&gt;Guide 1 is a reference document that provides information on biomarkers and their role in diagnosing gliomas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c7418fb993bb3daa95d8563909da1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc89a92e9a97781ebca0db50abc34939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06</data>
