    <node id="Diarrhea">
      <data key="d0">Diarrhea</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Diarrhea is a common side effect of systemic therapy, involving frequent, loose bowel movements.&lt;SEP&gt;Diarrhea is a common side effect of systemic therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diarrhea is a short-term side effect of radiation therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diarrhea is a common side effect of chemotherapy regimens used in the treatment of anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Diarrhea is a common side effect of chemotherapy, often linked to the gastrointestinal system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e138ec8da954a5667dc785e919c86b</data>
