      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The hypopharynx is the lower part of the throat near the voice box.&lt;SEP&gt;The hypopharynx is the lower part of the pharynx, located behind the larynx.&lt;SEP&gt;The hypopharynx is the area behind the voice box, part of the throat that is examined during laryngoscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;The hypopharynx is the lower part of the pharynx, near the larynx, and is a site where cancer can occur.</data>
