      <data key="d2">A high-volume center is a hospital or facility with significant experience in treating specific types of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-volume center is a medical facility with significant experience in treating specific types of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-volume center is a hospital or facility with experience in treating specific types of cancer, particularly head and neck cancers.</data>
