      <data key="d2">A prostate biopsy is a procedure where tissue samples are taken from the prostate to check for cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A prostate biopsy is a medical procedure used to remove tissue samples from the prostate for cancer diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;A prostate biopsy is a specific type of biopsy that uses a hollow needle to remove tissue samples from the prostate gland for examination.</data>
