    <node id="Mouth Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Mouth Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Mouth cancer is a type of cancer affecting the oral cavity, including the lips, tongue, gums, and other mouth structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer refers to cancer that develops in the oral cavity, including parts like the lips, cheeks, tongue, and gums.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer is a type of head and neck cancer that affects the oral cavity and can be influenced by genetic mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer refers to cancers affecting the oral cavity, including the lips and mucosa of the mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer is a type of cancer that occurs in the oral cavity or mouth.</data>
