    <node id="Cancer Care">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Care</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer care encompasses the diagnosis, treatment, and ongoing management of cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer care refers to the medical treatment and support provided to individuals diagnosed with cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer care refers to the medical treatment and management of cancer, which varies based on individual circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer care refers to the medical treatment and management of cancer, tailored to individual patient needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer Care is the comprehensive approach to managing and treating cancer.</data>
