    <node id="Thymus">
      <data key="d0">Thymus</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The thymus is a small organ in the upper chest where lymphocytes develop into T cells.&lt;SEP&gt;The thymus is an organ involved in the development of T lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;The thymus is a small organ located in front of the windpipe, important for T-cell development.&lt;SEP&gt;The thymus is a small organ located in front of the windpipe where T-cells mature.&lt;SEP&gt;Thymus is an organ in the lymph system that plays a role in immune function.</data>
