    <node id="Stage IV Anal Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Stage IV Anal Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Stage IV anal cancer is metastatic, meaning it has spread beyond the pelvis to distant sites like the liver or lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Stage IV anal cancer refers to advanced anal cancer that has metastasized before diagnosis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f</data>
