    <node id="Resection">
      <data key="d0">Resection</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Resection is a surgical procedure to remove a portion of tissue, often used to eliminate cancerous growths.&lt;SEP&gt;A resection is a surgical procedure that removes part or all of a tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;Resection is a surgical procedure to remove part of the bladder for diagnostic purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa2c7020ce6e89888e81972588726e3</data>
