      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">A double-barreled wet colostomy is a type of colostomy that combines both urinary and fecal diversions into one stoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317</data>
