    <node id="Stereotactic Body Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Stereotactic Body Radiation Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Stereotactic body radiation therapy (SBRT) is a specialized form of EBRT used to deliver high-dose radiation to metastatic tumors in few sessions.&lt;SEP&gt;Stereotactic body radiation therapy is a specialized form of external beam radiation therapy used to treat tumors with high precision.&lt;SEP&gt;Stereotactic body radiation therapy (SBRT) is a specialized form of radiation therapy used for limited metastases.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072</data>
