    <node id="Cancer Stages">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Stages</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer stages refer to the classification of the progression of cancer, such as intrahepatic bile duct cancer, based on tumor size and spread.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer stages classify the extent of cancer in the body, guiding treatment decisions and predicting prognosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer stages describe the extent of cancer in the body, helping to guide treatment decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00f93aa3d24d0275d4290db3fb2cca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7390896141393e0b4d1c15df77b5c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616</data>
