    <node id="Corticosteroids">
      <data key="d0">Corticosteroids</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Corticosteroids are medications sometimes used in hormone therapy for prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are a type of steroid medication used to treat inflammation and immune system responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are medications used to reduce inflammation and manage symptoms in cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-53c0ac935ec10ce8a0839db4ad053ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
