    <node id="Breast">
      <data key="d0">Breast</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The breast is a glandular organ found on the chest, consisting of milk ducts, fat, nerves, blood and lymph vessels, and connective tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;The breast is a glandular organ located on the chest that contains milk ducts, fat, nerves, and other tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;The breast is an organ and gland located on the chest, responsible for producing milk and containing various structures such as ducts and lobules.&lt;SEP&gt;Breast is an organ in the female body that produces milk and is a common site for cancer.</data>
