      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Local metastasis refers to cancer that has spread to nearby areas, such as the axillary lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Local metastasis refers to cancer spreading to nearby body parts such as axillary lymph nodes.</data>
