      <data key="d2">A glioma is a type of brain tumor that arises from glial cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A glioma is a type of brain tumor that originates from glial cells and can affect brain function.&lt;SEP&gt;A glioma is a type of malignant brain tumor that originates from glial cells, which support nerve cells in the central nervous system.&lt;SEP&gt;A glioma is a type of tumor that originates in the glial cells of the brain or spinal cord.&lt;SEP&gt;A glioma is a type of brain tumor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffc3446f8ec092af24a460bda94f772f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
