      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Chromosome is a structure in cells that carries genetic information and is involved in the formation of the Philadelphia chromosome.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromosomes are structures within cells that contain DNA and carry genetic information.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromosomes are structures that contain DNA and genetic information.&lt;SEP&gt;A chromosome is a structure composed of DNA and proteins, found in the nucleus of cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A chromosome is a structure made of DNA and proteins that carries genetic information in the cell.</data>
