      <data key="d0">Molecular Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Molecular testing analyzes genetic material in cancer cells to identify mutations and other features that may influence treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Molecular testing is a type of genetic analysis used to detect specific molecular changes in cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Molecular testing involves analyzing genetic material to identify specific characteristics of a tumor.</data>
