    <node id="Tumor Profiling">
      <data key="d0">Tumor Profiling</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tumor profiling is a process that examines the genetic makeup of a tumor to inform treatment strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumor profiling is a process that analyzes the genetic makeup of cancer cells to guide treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumor profiling is a process used to analyze the genetic and molecular characteristics of a tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumor profiling is a method of analyzing a tumor's molecular characteristics to guide treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumor profiling is a process that analyzes the molecular features of a tumor to guide treatment decisions.</data>
