      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">MSI-H/dMMR mutation refers to a type of genetic instability caused by defects in DNA repair mechanisms, often seen in certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;MSI-H/dMMR Mutation refers to a genetic condition where microsatellites in DNA are unstable due to defective mismatch repair proteins.</data>
