      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Immune checkpoint inhibitor therapy is a type of immunotherapy that helps the immune system recognize and attack cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune checkpoint inhibitor therapy is a type of cancer treatment that helps the immune system fight cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune checkpoint inhibitor therapy is a type of cancer treatment that helps the immune system recognize and attack cancer cells.</data>
