      <data key="d2">Phase 3 trials compare a new drug or treatment approach with a standard treatment to determine its efficacy and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;A Phase 3 trial compares a new treatment to a standard treatment to determine its effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase 3 trials test a drug or approach against a standard treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase 3 trials compare a new drug or treatment against a standard treatment to determine its effectiveness and safety.</data>
