      <data key="d2">Online portals are digital platforms used to access test results and provide information to patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Online portals are digital platforms that allow patients to access their medical test results and other health information.&lt;SEP&gt;Online portals are digital platforms that allow patients to access their test results and other medical information.</data>
