      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">Invasive ductal carcinoma is the most common type of breast cancer that starts in the milk ducts and spreads into surrounding tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive ductal carcinoma is a common type of breast cancer that starts in the milk ducts and spreads into surrounding tissue.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649</data>
