    <node id="Anatomic Staging">
      <data key="d0">Anatomic Staging</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Anatomic staging is a method of cancer staging based on the extent of cancer as defined by tumor size, lymph node status, and distant metastasis.</data>
