    <node id="Screening Mammogram">
      <data key="d0">Screening Mammogram</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A screening mammogram is a routine x-ray of the breast performed when there are no symptoms of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A screening mammogram is a routine x-ray of the breast used to detect early signs of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A screening mammogram is a routine imaging test used to detect breast cancer in asymptomatic individuals.</data>
