      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is a federal agency responsible for approving drugs and medical devices.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is a regulatory agency responsible for approving new drugs and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is a federal agency responsible for approving new cancer treatments.</data>
