      <data key="d2">PALB2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and ovarian cancer, and may also be linked to prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;PALB2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast and pancreatic cancers when mutated.&lt;SEP&gt;PALB2 is a gene associated with an increased risk of breast cancer when mutated.</data>
