      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Molecular biomarker testing is a procedure used to identify specific genetic markers associated with cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Molecular biomarker testing analyzes the molecular components of a tumor to assess cancer risk and guide treatment decisions.</data>
