    <node id="Life Expectancy">
      <data key="d0">Life Expectancy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Life expectancy is a factor considered in assessing the prognosis of prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Life expectancy is the projected duration of life for a patient based on their condition and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;An estimate of how long a person is expected to live based on their health condition and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a870810cef881997b741c32ec368fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a</data>
