    <node id="Molecular Tumor Testing">
      <data key="d0">Molecular Tumor Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Molecular tumor testing is a method of analyzing a tumor's molecular components to assess cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Molecular tumor testing is a diagnostic method that examines the molecular components of a tumor to identify genetic abnormalities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176</data>
