    <node id="Stem Cells">
      <data key="d0">Stem Cells</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Stem cells are undifferentiated cells that can develop into various types of blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cells are early blood-forming cells found in the bone marrow that can develop into different types of blood cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956</data>
