    <node id="Bone Marrow Test">
      <data key="d0">Bone Marrow Test</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A bone marrow test is a procedure to examine the bone marrow for signs of disease.&lt;SEP&gt;A bone marrow test involves removing and analyzing samples of bone marrow to diagnose conditions like leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A Bone Marrow Test involves collecting samples from the hip bone to examine for abnormalities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0786666c65b5bf00705439d5cb60d5a0</data>
