    </node>
    <node id="Hearing Problems">
      <data key="d0">Hearing Problems</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Hearing Problems can occur as a side effect of cisplatin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hearing problems can occur as a result of cisplatin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hearing problems or hearing loss can be a long-term side effect of extended treatment with cisplatin.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef</data>
