      <data key="d0">Nurse Practitioner</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A nurse practitioner is a healthcare provider who can perform many of the duties of a physician.&lt;SEP&gt;A Nurse Practitioner is a registered nurse with advanced training who provides medical care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
