      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A physician assistant is a healthcare provider who works under the supervision of a physician.&lt;SEP&gt;A Physician Assistant is a healthcare professional who works under the supervision of a physician.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
