    <node id="Chapter 6">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 6</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 6 addresses BCR::ABL1-positive B-ALL, detailing treatments aimed at inhibiting the BCR::ABL protein.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 6 covers chordoma treatment options, which include surgery or radiation therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
