    </node>
    <node id="Chapter 7">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 7</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter 7 covers T-ALL, a less common type of leukemia originating in T-cell lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 7 discusses Ewing sarcoma treatment options, starting with systemic therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
