      <data key="d0">Intrauterine Devices</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Intrauterine Devices are a form of birth control used to prevent pregnancy during cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Intrauterine devices are contraceptive tools that can prevent pregnancy during cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
