    <node id="Treatment Planning">
      <data key="d0">Treatment Planning</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Treatment planning is the process of determining the best course of action for cancer care based on diagnostic results.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment planning involves determining the best approach to diagnose and treat bone cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910</data>
