    </node>
    <node id="p16 (HPV) Testing">
      <data key="d0">p16 (HPV) Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">p16 testing is a method used to detect human papillomavirus (HPV) in biopsy samples, relevant for diagnosing certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;p16 (HPV) Testing is a diagnostic method used to detect HPV infection in throat cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839813</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Nutrition Evaluation">
      <data key="d0">Nutrition Evaluation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Nutrition evaluation is part of the diagnostic process to assess a patient's health status.&lt;SEP&gt;A nutrition evaluation assesses a patient's dietary needs and how cancer treatment may affect their nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839813</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Speech Evaluation">
      <data key="d0">Speech Evaluation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Speech evaluation is conducted to assess speech function, which may be affected by cancer or treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A speech evaluation assesses a patient's ability to speak and may be necessary following head and neck cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839813</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Swallowing Evaluation">
      <data key="d0">Swallowing Evaluation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Swallowing evaluation is performed to determine if cancer or treatment affects the ability to swallow.&lt;SEP&gt;A swallowing evaluation determines a patient's ability to swallow safely and effectively, often conducted after head and neck cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839813</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Healthcare Provider">
      <data key="d0">Healthcare Provider</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Healthcare Provider is a professional who delivers medical care and guidance to patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare provider is a professional or institution that offers medical care and treatment to patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare provider is a professional or organization that delivers medical care and services.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare provider is an individual or organization that delivers medical care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664</data>
