      <data key="d0">BRCA Genes</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">BRCA Genes are genes associated with hereditary cancer and mutations in these genes can increase cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;BRCA genes are responsible for repairing damaged DNA, and mutations in these genes increase cancer risk.</data>
