      <data key="d2">A Scope is a long, thin tube with a light and camera used to examine internal organs during medical procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;A scope is a thin, tubular tool used to examine internal body structures, such as the throat.&lt;SEP&gt;A scope is a thin, tube-shaped tool used in scoping procedures to examine internal body structures.</data>
