      <data key="d0">Homologous Recombination Deficiency (HRD)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Homologous Recombination Deficiency (HRD) is a condition in which the DNA repair mechanism is impaired, often associated with BRCA mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;HRD is a condition where cancer cells have impaired DNA repair mechanisms.</data>
