      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">BRAF V600E Mutation is a genetic change associated with certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;BRAF V600E mutation is a specific genetic alteration in the BRAF gene that can be targeted with certain drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;BRAF V600E mutation is a specific genetic alteration that can influence treatment strategies in some cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
