      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">RET Mutations are genetic changes that may be linked to specific cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;RET mutations are genetic alterations that can drive cancer growth and may be targeted with specific therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;RET mutations are genetic alterations that can influence treatment options in some cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
