    <node id="NTRK Gene Fusion">
      <data key="d0">NTRK Gene Fusion</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">NTRK Gene Fusion is a genetic abnormality associated with certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;NTRK gene fusion is a genetic abnormality that can lead to cancer development and is a target for certain treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;NTRK gene fusion is a genetic change associated with certain cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;NTRK gene fusion is a genetic abnormality linked to specific cancers and may guide targeted therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96</data>
