      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lymph node status indicates whether cancer has spread to nearby lymph nodes and is a key component of cancer staging.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymph node status indicates whether cancer has spread to regional lymph nodes and is categorized as N0, N1mi, N1, N2, or N3.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8639a06098656be20a04fe129660616</data>
