      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Prognostic refers to a staging system that includes anatomic TNM, tumor grade, and biomarker status to predict outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f05c8ea6f7c7b4ba1fb0ff1c1733980</data>
