    <node id="Differential">
      <data key="d0">Differential</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Differential is a blood test that identifies the types of white blood cells present in the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;A differential is a medical test that counts the number of each type of white blood cell and checks their balance.&lt;SEP&gt;A differential counts the number of each type of white blood cell in the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential is a medical test that counts and analyzes white blood cells in the blood.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae28e3852f4a9f229250fc19eb39036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7ea43a74059d6781866faec437f19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68</data>
