    <node id="CLL">
      <data key="d0">CLL</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">CLL is a type of cancer that affects blood and bone marrow, characterized by the accumulation of abnormal lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;CLL stands for Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia, a type of cancer that affects B cells.&lt;SEP&gt;CLL is a type of cancer that affects white blood cells, specifically B cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
