      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Watch and Wait is a period of monitoring for CLL where treatment is delayed until symptoms or blood test results indicate the need for intervention.&lt;SEP&gt;Watch and Wait is a strategy where no active treatment is given unless symptoms develop.</data>
