    <node id="Open MRI">
      <data key="d0">Open MRI</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">An open MRI has a magnetic top and bottom, allowing for an opening on each end, making it more suitable for patients with claustrophobia.&lt;SEP&gt;An open MRI is a type of MRI machine with a magnetic top and bottom, allowing for an opening on each end.&lt;SEP&gt;An Open MRI is a type of MRI with a magnetic top and bottom, allowing for openings on each end.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
