    <node id="Closed MRI">
      <data key="d0">Closed MRI</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">A closed MRI is a more common type of MRI that encloses the patient, which may cause discomfort for those with claustrophobia.&lt;SEP&gt;A closed MRI is a type of MRI machine with a capsule-like design where the magnet surrounds the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;A Closed MRI is a traditional MRI with a narrow tunnel, which may cause discomfort for individuals with claustrophobia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
