      <data key="d0">Laryngoscope</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A laryngoscope is a scope used in direct laryngoscopy to examine the throat and take tissue samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A laryngoscope is a medical instrument used in laryngoscopy to examine the throat and voice box.</data>
