      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Radiation exposure refers to the amount of radiation a patient receives during imaging procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation exposure, especially to the head or neck, is a known risk factor for developing thyroid cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc</data>
