      <data key="d2">Acute myeloid leukemia is a fast-growing cancer that affects the blood and bone marrow.&lt;SEP&gt;Acute myeloid leukemia is a fast-growing blood cancer originating in the bone marrow.&lt;SEP&gt;Acute Myeloid Leukemia is a type of blood cancer characterized by the rapid growth of abnormal white blood cells in the bone marrow.</data>
