      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Airways of the lungs include the trachea, bronchi, bronchioli, and alveoli, through which air travels during respiration.&lt;SEP&gt;The Airways of the Lungs are the network of air passages through which air travels during respiration.</data>
