    <node id="5-FU">
      <data key="d0">5-FU</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">5-FU is a chemotherapy drug given by continuous infusion over several days as part of treatment regimens for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;5-FU is a chemotherapy drug used in combination with mitomycin or cisplatin for treating perianal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;5-FU is a chemotherapy drug commonly used in regimens for treating anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;5-FU (Fluorouracil) is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;5-FU is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of cancer, often as part of chemoradiation.</data>
