      <data key="d2">Kidney damage is a potential side effect of certain chemotherapy treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney Damage is a risk associated with cisplatin use, limiting its suitability for some patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney damage is a potential side effect of platinum-based chemotherapy, including carboplatin, cisplatin, and oxaliplatin.</data>
