      <data key="d0">Intraocular Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Intraocular chemotherapy is a treatment where chemotherapy drugs are infused directly into the eye for rare cases of primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
