      <data key="d0">Whole-Brain Radiation Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Whole-brain radiation therapy (WBRT) is a technique that treats the entire brain to address multiple areas of primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Whole-Brain Radiation Therapy is a radiation technique used to treat primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
