    <node id="Low Blood Cell Counts">
      <data key="d0">Low Blood Cell Counts</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Low blood cell counts are a common side effect of systemic therapy, indicating a decrease in the number of blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Low blood cell counts are a side effect of chemotherapy, potentially leading to increased susceptibility to infections.&lt;SEP&gt;Low blood cell counts are a common side effect of systemic therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0</data>
