    <node id="Lymph Fluid">
      <data key="d0">Lymph Fluid</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Lymph fluid is a bodily fluid through which cancer cells can travel to form tumors in other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymph fluid is a clear fluid that circulates through the lymphatic system, helping to fight infections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e8ac9bf8f198bc5ad54fd1a7b843e810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7390896141393e0b4d1c15df77b5c0a7</data>
