      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Superficial treatments are therapies that affect only the top layer of the skin and are used for early forms of squamous cell skin cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e8ac9bf8f198bc5ad54fd1a7b843e810</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772839840</data>
