      <data key="d0">Muscle Weakness</data>
      <data key="d1">symptom</data>
      <data key="d2">Muscle weakness is a condition where a person experiences reduced strength in their muscles, often a symptom of brain tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Muscle weakness on one side of the body is a possible symptom of a brain tumor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
