    <node id="SLL">
      <data key="d0">SLL</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Small lymphocytic lymphoma (SLL) is a type of cancer that is closely related to CLL, differing mainly in where the abnormal cells are located.</data>
