      <data key="d0">Blood Smear</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A blood smear is a laboratory test where a drop of blood is examined under a microscope to identify abnormal cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A blood smear is a laboratory procedure where a thin layer of blood is examined under a microscope.</data>
