      <data key="d0">CD20</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">CD20 is a surface protein found on B cells and is used to identify CLL cells.&lt;SEP&gt;CD20 is a protein found on the surface of B cells, used as a target for medical treatments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648</data>
