      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">PET/CT is a combined imaging technique that uses positron emission tomography and computed tomography to locate cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;PET/CT is an advanced imaging test that uses special injectable agents to detect cancer spread beyond lymph nodes.</data>
