      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The tongue is a muscular organ in the mouth that aids in chewing, speaking, and breathing.&lt;SEP&gt;The tongue is a muscular organ in the mouth used for tasting, swallowing, and speaking.</data>
