      <data key="d0">Folate Receptor Alpha</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Folate receptor alpha is a protein expressed on some cancer cells that may be a target for therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Folate receptor alpha (FRα) is a biomarker that can guide treatment decisions in certain types of ovarian cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
