    <node id="Omentum">
      <data key="d0">Omentum</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The omentum is a fatty layer of tissue that covers the organs in the abdomen and can be a site for cancer metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Omentum is a fatty layer of tissue in the abdomen that may contain cancer cells and is often removed during surgery.</data>
