    <node id="Translocation">
      <data key="d0">Translocation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Translocation is a genetic change where parts of two chromosomes are exchanged.&lt;SEP&gt;A Translocation is a genetic error where parts of two chromosomes break off and switch places, leading to gene fusions.</data>
