      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Mitomycin is a chemotherapy drug used in combination regimens for treating anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Mitomycin is a chemotherapy drug used in combination with capecitabine or 5-FU for treating perianal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Mitomycin is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdcce851d69aa713ed64ba1895bd5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519</data>
