    <node id="Paclitaxel">
      <data key="d0">Paclitaxel</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Paclitaxel is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Paclitaxel is a taxane chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Paclitaxel is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of several cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Paclitaxel is a chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of various cancers, including cervical cancer.</data>
