      <data key="d0">Docetaxel</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Docetaxel is a taxane chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Docetaxel is a chemotherapy drug used to treat various types of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Docetaxel is a chemotherapy drug used in the modified DCF regimen for metastatic anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
