    <node id="Bevacizumab">
      <data key="d0">Bevacizumab</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Bevacizumab is a targeted therapy drug used in the treatment of ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Bevacizumab is a drug that inhibits the growth of new blood vessels feeding tumors and may be added to chemotherapy regimens.&lt;SEP&gt;Bevacizumab is a medication used in chemotherapy to stop the growth of blood vessels that feed tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Bevacizumab (Avastin) is a targeted therapy drug used in the treatment of recurrent ovarian cancer, often in combination with chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Bevacizumab (Avastin) is a targeted therapy drug used in combination with chemotherapy for certain cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
