      <data key="d0">B Cell</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A B cell is a type of white blood cell involved in the immune system and can become abnormal in CLL.&lt;SEP&gt;B cells are a type of white blood cell involved in the immune response.</data>
