      <data key="d0">Complication</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A complication is an unintended and unplanned outcome of a medical procedure, such as infection or bleeding.&lt;SEP&gt;A complication is an unexpected and unwanted outcome that may occur as a result of a medical procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;A complication is an unwanted and unplanned result that may occur after a medical procedure, such as infection or bleeding.</data>
