      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An acquired mutation is a genetic change that occurs in some cells of the body later in life, not inherited.&lt;SEP&gt;An acquired mutation is a genetic change that occurs in some cells during a person's lifetime, not inherited from parents.</data>
