      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A sexually transmitted infection is an infection spread through sexual contact, increasing the risk of cervical cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;STIs are infections spread through sexual contact and can increase the risk of anal cancer.</data>
