    <edge source="Bone Marrow" target="Blood Stem Cells">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Bone marrow is the source of blood stem cells, which produce all types of blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood stem cells in the bone marrow develop into various types of blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood stem cells are found in the bone marrow and are responsible for generating all blood cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow contains blood stem cells that generate all types of blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow is the source of blood stem cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow is the source of blood stem cells, which give rise to all types of blood cells.</data>
