    <edge source="Immunotherapy" target="Systemic Therapy">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Immunotherapy, Systemic Therapy is a category of medical treatment that involves using the body's immune system to fight cancer. Immunotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that stimulates or enhances the immune system's ability to recognize and attack cancer cells. It is often used as an alternative treatment option within the broader framework of systemic therapies, which are designed to affect the entire body rather than just a localized area. Systemic therapy includes immunotherapy, alongside other treatments such as chemotherapy, and is intended to target cancer throughout the body. Immunotherapy specifically activates the immune system to combat cancer, making it a key component of systemic cancer treatment strategies. It is also described as a form of systemic therapy that enhances the body's immune response against cancer, emphasizing its role in leveraging the body’s natural defenses. Overall, Immunotherapy, Systemic Therapy represents a therapeutic approach that integrates the principles of systemic treatment with the targeted activation of the immune system to fight cancer.</data>
      <data key="d9">alternative therapy,cancer therapy,cancer treatment,immune activation,immune modulation,immune system activation,immune-based therapy,therapeutic approach,therapy type,treatment,treatment approach,treatment category,treatment method,treatment modality,treatment type,type</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0</data>
