    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Cisplatin">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cisplatin is a chemotherapy drug that contains platinum and is used to treat cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is a specific chemotherapy drug used to treat squamous cell skin cancer and other cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is a platinum-based chemotherapy drug used in cervical cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is administered intravenously as part of chemotherapy regimens.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy regimens may include Cisplatin in combination with other drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is a key component of several chemotherapy regimens for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is a chemotherapy drug used in treatment regimens for anal cancer.</data>
