    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Side Effects">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Chemotherapy leads to various side effects that require management.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause side effects that vary depending on the drug and dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause a variety of side effects, depending on the drug, dose, and individual response.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy often causes side effects such as nausea, vomiting, and fatigue.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause harsh side effects due to its impact on healthy cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause side effects such as nausea, vomiting, and low blood cell counts.&lt;SEP&gt;Side effects are unintended consequences of medical treatments, often including physical or emotional discomfort.</data>
