    <edge source="Oropharynx" target="Pharynx">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The oropharynx is a part of the pharynx, which is a larger structure in the throat.&lt;SEP&gt;The pharynx is divided into three parts, including the oropharynx, which is located behind the mouth.</data>
      <data key="d9">anatomical relationship,anatomical structure,part of throat,part-whole</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c9383db20cd696688798a193862cb5cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b</data>
