    <edge source="Oropharynx" target="Throat Cancer">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Throat cancer originates in the oropharynx, which includes the soft palate, tonsils, and base of the tongue.&lt;SEP&gt;Throat cancer can develop in the oropharynx, which is part of the throat.</data>
      <data key="d9">anatomical site,cancer location</data>
