    <edge source="Dental Exam" target="Head and Neck Cancer">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A Dental Exam is important for patients with Head and Neck Cancer to monitor oral health.&lt;SEP&gt;Head and neck cancer can affect the health of the jaw, teeth, and gums, making regular dental exams important.</data>
      <data key="d9">cancer impact,dental care,health impact,oral health monitoring</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0</data>
