    </edge>
    <edge source="Ultrasound" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Ultrasound is used to guide biopsies, particularly for lymph node sampling.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultrasound is sometimes used to guide a fine-needle biopsy for tissue sampling.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultrasound is used to guide biopsies, particularly transrectal ultrasound in prostate biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultrasound is used to guide biopsies, such as breast biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultrasound can be used to guide a fine-needle biopsy to collect tissue samples for analysis.</data>
