    <edge source="Imaging Tests" target="Radiologist">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Imaging tests are interpreted by a radiologist who provides a report to the health care provider.&lt;SEP&gt;A radiologist interprets imaging test results for rectal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A radiologist interprets imaging tests and provides reports to the care team.&lt;SEP&gt;A radiologist interprets imaging tests such as bone scans and provides reports to the treating physician.&lt;SEP&gt;A radiologist interprets imaging tests and provides reports to health care providers.</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,diagnostic interpretation,diagnostic report,diagnostic support,expert interpretation,interpretation,medical expertise,medical interpretation,medical report</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-925a474b4538dda470bfd817f9d9a17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db4e8318949a3fda5683c53985c6af05</data>
