    </edge>
    <edge source="Imaging Tests" target="Contrast Material">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Contrast material improves image quality during imaging tests, making internal structures more visible.&lt;SEP&gt;Contrast Material is used in Imaging Tests to improve the visibility of internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Contrast material is used to improve the clarity of imaging tests.&lt;SEP&gt;Contrast material is used to improve the clarity of images during CT and MRI scans.&lt;SEP&gt;Contrast material is used in imaging tests to improve image clarity.</data>
      <data key="d9">contrast enhancement,diagnostic aid,diagnostic clarity,diagnostic support,diagnostic tool,enhancement,image clarity,imaging enhancement,medical enhancement</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db4e8318949a3fda5683c53985c6af05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1772839926</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Imaging Tests" target="Patient Portal">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
